<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Arum Bibleh translation</book>
  <para style="h">Romawa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Romawa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Romawa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="mt1">Romawa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Amgbasho ata areh anyi na amya, Ablusu. Mya meh bu ahwra Kristi Yeso. Nnoh a seh meh la meh ti bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh sa tohmoh nana. A tohmoh meh la meh ti na ni bleh tsifa nana reh ma kyangwri mboh.<verse eid="ROM 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />A bu tsifa nana wohroh reh, ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya na kpikpi ma aki amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh, tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho ata zanana Nnoh reh. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3" />Tsifa nana reh a bu ma ikpi amehreh Nnoh, ŋoh nza bu Yeso Kristi, Ada ambohroh. Tama a mara Yeso reh tswanza itoh kyangwri ata nza anyi nimeh alohsoh Dawuda, <verse eid="ROM 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4" />nza a bu nimeh zanana ata huru a ŋoh reh, tasa na wuwana ma a tsana la ŋoh reh a bu amehreh Nnoh ma atsi hinga a ŋoh anyi ma kwo reh. Ma a tsana za la Yeso Kristi reh a bu Ada ambohroh. <verse eid="ROM 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />A bu ma ikpi Yeso Kristi meh hunji lisa alindeh tasa za la mata a nga isa Nnoh agba, Nnoh a nga meh aki la meh ti bu kyangwri sa tohmoh nana Kristi, la meh ti fi kyangwri mboh nyi ma inziyo mata nga agohsoh amoh na a ŋoh tasa za mata a tufa ŋoh. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Tasa mohnoh amboh tufa Nnoh ata nza ni yama nnoh ma Roma reh, ni bu noh nimeh kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a fi mboh la mata a bu Yeso Kristi a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Mya Ablusu meh ŋa amgbasho ata areh ba nnoh, mohnoh ambohroh mboh amboh tufa Nnoh mboh ata mohnoh nza ni yama nnoh ma Roma, Nnoh nza a kira na amohnoh tasa za a fi noh la ti bu noh kyangwri Nnoh mboh amboh zanana reh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Lisa alindeh tasa tuma alindeh ta anyi na Nnoh Ada ambohroh tasa Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi a ba na amohnoh.<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwehreh ata Kwende Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Na jiji ŋoh reh, meh kwende ma Nnoh nimeh sa Yeso Kristi tsifa amohnoh nambri, tsifa la ma a leh a bleh tsifa nga agohsoh amohnoh reh a treh atsifi ma inziyo areh nambri. <verse eid="ROM 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Nnoh a bleh ma ikpi amya la andromboh ata mya nza ni leh bleh reh a bu zizi, Nnoh ata mya nza ni leh krumusu ŋoh na huru amya atsi hwra tsifa nana ma ikpi amehreh Nnoh. Nnoh a wina la meh leh kohnoh na amohnoh na tutu, <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />nimeh kwere Nnoh amya na tutu reh, meh kǝ kwere ŋoh la nza a bu kira a ŋoh reh, aki ta a vuru na meh meh ti ba na amohnoh.<verse eid="ROM 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />A te meh iko la meh ti ba na amohnoh, a bu tsifa la meh ti ba bu nga nnoh ngǝnga anyi ata huru nza a nati a nga noh wuwana ti tufa nnoh Nnoh alindeh. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />A bu kira amya la, Mbohroh ma amohnoh meh ti nga wuwana ma itoh ambohroh, meh ti nga nnoh wuwana na nga agohsoh amya, mohnoh za ti nga meh noh wuwana amohnoh.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, meh kira ti wina noh la, meh tini leh fa akeki ba na amohnoh te lo vara, a treh a gu a ba ba te nehnehreh za neh, ma a hehreh a nga meh kira kpeh. Meh kira la meh ti shingi nnoh ti krumusu nnoh Nnoh reh alindeh, tswanza meh ti kǝ shingi amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh.<verse eid="ROM 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Ndohmoh kyangwri mboh reh nambri a yama ma ikpi amya, ata kyangwri amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu achifi mboh, tasa amboh ata nza ma a bu na lomo, tasa amboh duduna mboh. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />A bu tsifa wohroh mya nza ni kira la meh ti ba bu hwra tsifa nana bleh noh reh, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni yama nnoh ma Romawa reh.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />A te meh sa na tsifa nana reh kpeh. A bu wuwana Nnoh nza a nati a nga nvara ma amboh ata nza ma a nga kira amoh reh, a nati a jiji a nga ma Yahudawa mboh, feh sa a nga ma amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Tsifa nana reh a tsana aki ata Nnoh nza a de kyangwri mboh mata tufa yehlehleh na a ŋoh reh: a bu ma aki nga agohsoh ata nza anyi jiji ŋoh a gu a ba ma trinaa reh. Tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata nza bu yehlehleh na Nnoh ma aki nga agohsoh a ŋoh reh a nati a bu na fene.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpakpana Kyangwri Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Nnoh ma inza a nati a tsana gofo a ŋoh na kyangwri amboh kpakpana mboh tasa amboh agugu ata nza ma lisa yehlehleh kpeh, ata ndohmoh agugu amoh reh a ha mata a wina andromboh ata nza a bu ata zizi reh. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Nnoh a nga mboh iya, tsifa la andromboh ata mboh nza ma a nati a wina ma ikpi Nnoh reh a bu ma inziyo ma na amoh, a bu Nnoh nza a tsana mboh reh. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Nza anyi ameh ata Nnoh ta ka a lisa inziyo reh, awumu amboh ata Mbohroh meh kǝ wina nza na iyo ambohroh kpeh, tasa wuwana a ŋoh ata tuma atono tasa awumu amboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa reh, ma a tsana mboh a kate kakende, ma a nza mboh a wina ma ikpi awumu amboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa reh. Nza a bu dehreh, kyangwri amboh wohroh reh ma a nati a wina bleh la ma a wina Nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />Kyangwri amboh wohroh reh ma a wina Nnoh, mboh neh ma a sohroh nga agba ma Nnoh ha mata a kwende ŋoh kpeh. Mboh reh ma a za a bu na kohnoh andromboh alindeh za kpeh, tasa za agohsoh amoh ata duduna reh kǝ hungwa ata ma a za a nati a sehreh tsifa Nnoh a wina za kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Mboh reh ma a nati a gu la ma a bu na lomo, mboh neh ma bu amboh duduna mboh, <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />ma ata ni riri Nnoh ata ka a kwo kpeh, mboh neh ma a gyuru ariri yafa mboh ata nza ma a lisa mboh ma a tswanza kyangwri amboh ata ma a nati a kwo, amboh anyi za ma a tswanza akuku mboh tasa woaye mboh tasa woaye amboh gbo na agohsoh mboh.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Nza ka a bu dehreh, Nnoh a yi kyangwri amboh ika wohroh reh ata la mata a leh a lisa awumu arishi ata agohsoh amoh tasa itoh amoh nza a kira lisa reh. Tasa za ma a lisa andromboh ata a nati a nga kyangwri mboh isa. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ma a gu tsifa Nnoh ata nza bu zizi reh a gyuru la ta a bu mboh tsifa huru tsifa, tasa za maka a leh krumusu awumu ata nza a bu Nnoh mi a lisa na ikpi a ŋoh reh, ma ata mata a krumusu Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh, ata ma a nati ariri ŋoh a nati tuma atono. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />A bu ma ikpi tsifa ata areh, Nnoh ata awumu isa abibi amboh hwa amwo iyo mboh reh ta a de mboh. ifiya amoh mboh ma a za a kira leh ahohndoh na tsifa mboh za kpeh, wohroh nza bu yehlehleh reh, ma a gyuru ka a leh ahohndoh na itoh amoh fiya mboh ata nza bu yehlehleh kpeh reh. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Ma aki wohroh za, tsifa mboh ma a za a kira tama a leh ahohndoh na ifiya mboh ma aki ata nza bu yehlehleh reh za kpeh. Tsifa mboh maka a leh a gyuru a lisa awumu isa abibi na tsifa mboh, ma a huru ma a nati wa iya ata nza a nati a bu yehlehleh na ndohmoh agugu amoh mboh reh.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Kyangwri amboh wohroh reh ma a kira la mata a wina Nnoh kpeh, Nnoh a nati a gu mboh a fi a na ma aki kohnoh abibi ata nza a nati a shingi mboh kpeh, tsifa la ma a lisa andromboh ata nza a zohhoh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Ma a bu na kohnoh ata nza bu yehlehleh kpeh, tasa ndohmoh agugu, tasa kira ikpi, tasa za mata a nga ma mgbiri mboh gofo; ma a bu na vene, tasa amboh mla kyangwri mboh kwo, tasa amboh fa mlana, tasa amboh agugu, tasa amboh agohsoh abibi. Mboh reh maka tsifa ma ikpi kyangwri <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />amboh tsifa agugu na itoh amoh, amboh fi Nnoh ma tohmoh, amboh hende kya kyangwri, amboh gu ikpi ka, amboh nza ma a keh kira na ikpi amoh, amboh te inyi, tasa amboh rina akekre amoh mboh tasa alehmeh amoh mboh; <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />ma a bu na lomo nza andromboh ata nza a zohhoh reh kpeh, tasa maka a bleh tsifa a su kpeh, tasa ma a bu na kira ha kwini kpeh na itoh amoh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Kyangwri amboh areh ma a wina tsifa Nnoh ma ikpi andromboh ata nza bu yehlehleh, ma a wina la amboh ata nza ma a lisa dehreh reh ma a tswa mata a mla mboh a kwo, mboh reh ma a lisa awumu abibi reh mboh tsimoh kpeh, maka a johjoh na mgbiri amboh ata nza maka a lisa abibi awumu ika wohroh reh za.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s1">Hwra Akpi Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />mohnoh ziza amya mboh, ni kǝ hwra noh akpi ma mgbiri mboh? Ni bu na andromboh ata ni nati bleh kpeh, ha ni kǝ bu anyi. Nza ni leh hwra akpi ma mgbiri, nnoh za ti leh lisa andromboh ata mboh nza ma a leh a lisa reh, ni lofo ikpi anzoh. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Mbohroh meh wina la hwra akpi Nnoh reh ma ikpi amboh ata nza maka a lisa ika wohroh reh a bu zizi. <verse eid="ROM 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Nnoh neh iza amya, ni leh lisa awumu amboh ata ni leh hwra akpi ma mgbiri! Nnoh ni nza anzoh la ni nati wina nvara na hwra akpi Nnoh reh? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Ha ni rina awumu alilehndeh, tasa soh ivoh yira, te gofo a ŋoh na gbugbo kpeh ma ikpi anzoh reh? Nnoh ni wina la a zohhoh na Nnoh la ti gyuruna ata aki agugu anzoh reh kpeh? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Nnoh neh ni bu noh na wuwa agohsoh tasa wuwa ikpi, ni leke ti ta aki agugu anzoh reh, hwra akpi agba a buti bana nnoh ibi ata gofo Nnoh tasa hwra akpi alindeh a ŋoh a nati a ba reh. <verse eid="ROM 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Nnoh a nati nga reh firoh ma ikpi ndohmoh ata mbohroh nza mi lisa reh. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Mgbiri kyangwri maka a leh a lisa alindeh nimeh soh ivoh yira, tasa maka a fa agba, tasa riri, tasa fene ata ka a trina kpeh; Nnoh a nati a nga mboh fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Mgbiri kyangwri neh ma bu amboh kira ikpi amoh, ma a leke mata gya agohsoh na tsifa Nnoh ata nza bu zizi reh, la ma a gyuru a leh a lisa andromboh ata nza bu yehlehleh kpeh, gofo tasa hungwa yira Nnoh reh a nati a bu ma ikpi amoh veve kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Nnoh a nati a nga iya agba ma fene kyangwri amboh nza maka a lisa agugu reh, a nati a jiji na amboh ata nza ma a bu Yahudawa mboh reh a treh feh sa ka a ba na amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Nnoh neh a nati a nga agba, tasa riri, tasa tuma alindeh ma amboh ata nza ma a lisa alindeh reh, a nati a jiji na Yahudawa mboh a treh feh sa ka a ba na amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Nnoh reh a nati ahwra akpi ma kyangwri mboh reh kira ikpi a nati a nati a yama kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh ma a bu na akpi reh kpeh, ma kpakpana tasa mboh tama a wina akpi reh kpeh. Yahudawa mboh reh neh tama a bu na akpi reh; ma a kpakpana, ma a nati hwra akpi amoh ata nza bu yehlehleh na akpi reh. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />A bu tsifa la amboh ata nza ma a sehreh akpi reh nza ma a bu yehlehleh ma tohmoh Nnoh kpeh, a bu amboh ata neh nza ma a tufa akpi reh nza ma a bu yehlehleh. <verse eid="ROM 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, ma a bu na akpi reh kpeh; ka a mehheh za maka a lisa andromboh ata akpi nza a bleh reh, ma ikpi andromboh ata agohsoh amoh mboh nza a bleh mboh la mata a lisa reh, ha neh ma a bu na akpi reh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Ndohmoh amoh reh a tsana la, andromboh ata akpi nza a bleh la ma a lisa reh, a bu ŋa gyaa nimeh agohsoh amoh mboh. Kohnoh ma agohsoh amoh za a tsana la ata areh a bu zizi, kohnoh ata agohsoh amoh reh ka a mehheh ka a de kpakpana a ba mboh, nza ka a mehheh reh ka a de kpakpana a ba mboh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Dehreh za, ma ikpi tsifa nana ata mya nza ni leh hwra bleh noh reh, a nati a bu dehreh ibi agba ata Nnoh ma aki Yeso Kristi a ba atsi hwra akpi awumu amboh ata nza ma a yama ma huho reh.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yahudawa Mboh Tasa Akpi Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Nza, nnoh ata nza ni leh fi ikpi anzoh la kyangwri Yahudawa reh neh? Nnoh ni gya agohsoh anzoh na na akpi reh, tasa za ni leh va ivoh ma agohsoh la ni bu na Nnoh, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />ni wina andromboh ata Nnoh nza a kira nnoh la ti lisa reh, tasa za akpi reh a tsana la ni nati wina tsara andromboh ata nza a zohhoh reh ti lisa yehlehleh, <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />nnoh na ikpi anzoh ni gya agohsoh la ni nati wina tsana aki ma amboh hama iyo mboh, ti de zana ba ma amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh shini reh, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />nnoh kyangwri tsana, ti tsana amboh duduna mboh tasa ti bu kyangwri tsana amboh ata kohnoh amoh a tswanza amehreh akǝkehreh mboh amoh. Nnoh reh ni gu la a bu nimeh akpi reh ni bu na wina gaga tasa zizi. <verse eid="ROM 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Nnoh ata nza ni leh tsana mgbiri reh, tsana ikpi anzoh reh feh reh! Nnoh ata nza ni leh hwra bleh la akyo ta kama a te ayuhu kpeh, nnoh reh neh ni kǝ te ayuhu kpeh? <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Tasa nnoh ata nza ni leh bleh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ta a kama a leh ahohndoh na akyo kpeh,&gt;&gt; nnoh reh neh ni kǝ leh ahohndoh na akyo kpeh? Nnoh ata za nza ni leh sehreh noh akǝkehreh mboh reh, ni kǝ te ayuhu nimeh ida nnoh akǝkehreh reh kpeh? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Ni bu kyangwri va ivoh ma agohsoh ma ikpi akpi reh, ni hehreh nga isa ma Nnoh ma aki kputu tsana a ŋoh reh kpeh? <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh la, &lt;&lt;A bu tsifa amohnoh Yahudawa mboh, amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, ma a leh a kya Nnoh tasa isa a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Nza ni tufa akpi reh, shimba kpa anzoh reh a nati a te ndohmoh. Nza nnoh neh ni tufa akpi reh kpeh, a nati a tswanza ma a hehreh a shimba nnoh kpanda kpeh reh. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Nza Yahudawa amboh ata nza ma shimba kpa amoh kpeh reh, ma a tufa akpi reh yehlehleh, Nnoh reh a nati a gu mboh tswanza ma a shimba mboh kpa kpeh? <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Tasa za, mohnoh Yahudawa mboh reh, amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, ma a nati a shimba nnoh akpi, tsifa la ni tufa akpi reh kpeh, nnoh ata nza ni hwra akpi ata nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho reh, tasa shimba kpa za; neh ma a tufa akpi reh, ha neh ma shimba mboh kpa ata itoh za kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Yahudawa ata a zizi reh a bu kyangwri ata nza bu Yahudawa ata itoh ma tsene kpeh, tasa za shimba kpa ata a zizi reh a bu ma ikpi kpra itoh ha ata fa bina itoh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Dehreh za, Yahudawa ata a zizi reh a bu ŋoh ata nza bu Yahudawa anyi nimeh agohsoh reh, tasa za shimba kpa ata a zizi reh a bu shimba kpa ata nza anyi nimeh agohsoh reh, wohroh reh a bu ndohmoh ata huru nza a lisa reh, a bu ma aki tsana ata nza ma a ŋa reh kpeh. biroh kyangwri ika ata areh a bu Nnoh mi a nati ariri ŋoh, a nati a sa anyi na kyangwri kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />A bu umbo a keh zohhoh mata a bleh la ni bu Yahudawa? Ha a bu umbo a zohhoh na shimba kpa reh? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Haa, ka a zohhoh ma akeki mboh reh atsetse! Jiji ŋoh, a bu Nnoh sa tsifa Yahudawa mboh reh a kira ta a nga mboh tohmoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Nza mgbiri amoh mboh reh ma a bu na nga agohsoh na Nnoh kpeh reh neh? Sa tsifa leke reh a nati a tsana la Nnoh reh a bu na nga agohsoh kpeh? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Wa! A bu dehreh kpeh, Nnoh reh a bu zizi, kyangwri mboh nambri ma bu amboh agugu mboh. Tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">&lt;&lt;Mata a sa tsifa anzoh reh a tsana la a bu zizi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">tasa za hwra akpi ata nza ma ahwra ma ikpi anzoh reh ma a nati a de noh na kpakpana kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Nza andromboh ata neh meh lisa yehlehleh kpeh reh, a tsana reh a kate la Nnoh reh a bu yehlehleh, Mbohroh meh nati kǝ bleh la umbo? Meh nati bleh la Nnoh reh a tufa yehlehleh kpeh ŋoh nza ahwra akpi ma amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa a kira kpeh reh? Ata areh a bu luhu ata kyangwri a nati a wina luhu. <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />Wa! Ata areh a bu dehreh kpeh! Nza a bu dehreh reh, Nnoh reh a nati a lisa lele feh sa ka hwra akpi ma inziyo reh? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Nza a nati a bu tsifa bleh huru tsifa amya reh neh, zizi Nnoh reh ta a kate ma inziyo gaga, ta ka a bu andromboh ata ma a nati a nga agba ma Nnoh reh, a bu lele feh ma a treh a nati ahwra meh akpi mya reh meh bu kyangwri kpakpana? <verse eid="ROM 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Nza a bu dehreh reh, Mbohroh meh ti leh rya tohmoh na lisa agugu ambohroh reh ma, ta ka a bu reh aki hunji andromboh alindeh reh kpeh? Mgbiri kyangwri mboh ma a leh atsifa a kputu reh isa la Mbohroh meh leh tsifa dehreh. Ma a nati ahwra akpi ma kyangwri amboh areh tswanza nza a zohhoh mata ahwra mboh reh.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyangwri Mboh Na Nambri Ma Bu amboh Kpakpana Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />Nehnehreh meh nati kǝ gu la umbo? Ha Mbohroh Yahudawa mboh reh meh keh mgbiri amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh? Mbimbi kpeh! Mbohroh timi gu la Yahudawa mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh ma a bu na kpakpana, tasa za nambri ma amoh a bu ma hohroh wuwana ata kpakpana. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Tswanza nza a bu ŋa nimeh amgbasho reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">&lt;&lt;Akyo anyi a yama ata nza a bu yehlehleh kpeh;<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />akyo anyi ata nza tsifa a wina reh a yama kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">akyo ata nza a kira ta a krumusu Nnoh reh a yama kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />Nambri ma amoh ma a gyuruna ata Nnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">kyangwri mboh reh nambri ma a te abibi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:12">akyo lisa alindeh a yama za kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">akyo anyimbehreh a yama kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />&lt;&lt;Iyo agba amoh a tswanza ikpi nyifo ata nza bu vuru reh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">arimi amoh ka a bleh huru tsifa na tutu.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:13">&lt;&lt;Tsifa amoh reh a tswanza toso anu reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />&lt;&lt;Aniye amoh a su na kya tasa tsifa abibi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />&lt;&lt;Maka a kira la mata a mla kyangwri mboh a kwo na gbugbo;<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />atsi ata nza ma a na reh, a bu lofona tasa hungwa yira ka a tufa mboh.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Ma a sohroh a wina aki tuma alindeh reh kpeh,<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />ha nyiri Nnoh a yama ma iyo amoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Nehnehreh Mbohroh meh wina la andromboh ata akpi nza a leh atsifa ma ikpi reh, a leh a hwa amboh ata nza ma a bu ma hohroh akpi reh mi. Ata areh a bu dehreh la mata a ha amboh ata ma a nati a bleh la a bu na aki kpeh, mata a tsana mboh za la inziyo reh na agba ma, a bu ma hohroh akpi Nnoh. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Akyo anyi a nati a wina bu yehlehleh ma tohmoh Nnoh ma aki tufa tsana ata akpi nza a bleh la mata a lisa reh kpeh. Andromboh ata akpi nza a lisa reh a nati a tsana itoh kyangwri kpakpana a ŋoh mboh.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnoh A lisa Kyangwri Mboh La Mata A bu Yelele Na A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Nehnehreh neh Mbohroh meh wina aki ata meh nati bu yehlehleh na Nnoh reh. Nnoh a tsana reh aki anyi ata ŋoh a nati a sa kyangwri mboh mata bu yehlehleh na a ŋoh reh. Aki reh a sohroh a bu nimeh akpi ta ka a de a ba reh kpeh. Akpi Musa reh neh tasa tohmoh ata nza anyi na amboh sa tohmoh a ŋoh mboh reh tama a bleh tsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Nnoh a sa kyangwri mboh reh mata a bu yehlehleh na a ŋoh tsifa Yeso Kristi a lisa andromboh ata ŋoh nza a kira reh. Nnoh reh a sa kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a nga agohsoh amoh mboh na kristi reh. A bu ma aki wohroh za nambri na kyangwri mboh reh, ha ma a bu Yahudawa ha amboh ata ma a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />kyangwri mboh reh nambri ma a kpakpana, tasa za ma anyinana ma tohmoh Nnoh. <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />Neh tsifa la Nnoh reh a bu na agohsoh alindeh, a sa reh la meh ti bu yehlehleh na a ŋoh. Ata a bu andromboh ata Nnoh reh a nga reh wusu. Yeso Kristi reh a fanga ikpi a ŋoh tsifa kpakpana ambohroh mboh la mata ata reh wusu. <verse eid="ROM 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25" />Nnoh a gu Yeso reh a fanga tsifa vari kpakpana ambohroh mboh reh, la ma aki sangra imya a ŋoh reh mata a te kohhroh na kpakpana kyangwri mboh reh ma aki nga agohsoh amoh ma Nnoh reh. Nnoh reh a lisa dehreh la ŋoh a tsana la ndohmoh alindeh a ŋoh reh, na kpikpi reh Nnoh tana a nga iya ma amboh ata nza ma a leh a kpakpana reh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26" />Tana a bu dehreh Nnoh a tsana agohsoh alindeh a ŋoh na ameh wohroh reh, tsifa ŋoh na ikpi a ŋoh a bu kyangwri alindeh tasa za ka a lisa akyo ata nza a nga kira a ŋoh na Yeso reh ta a bu na kpakpana kpeh ma tohmoh Nnoh.<verse eid="ROM 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Nehnehreh meh nati kǝ va ivoh ma agohsoh na umbo? Andromboh a yama kpeh! A nati a bu ma ikpi umbo? ma a nati a gu va ivoh ma agohsoh reh a kate? Ha a nati a bu ma ikpi tufa akpi reh? Uwa, a nati a bu ma ikpi nga agohsoh ambohroh na Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Mbohroh meh kira nehnehreh la a bu ma aki nga agohsoh ma Nnoh ma a nati a wina a hunji kyangwri na kpakpana kpeh ma tohmoh Nnoh, a sohroh a bu ma aki tufa tsana akpi reh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Ha Nnoh reh a bu Nnoh ata Yahudawa mboh ma tsene? A bu kyangwri amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh? A bu dehreh zizi ŋoh za a bu Nnoh amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh za, <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Nnoh reh a bu anyimbehreh, a nati a lisa amboh ata nza ma a shimba mboh kpa kpeh mata a bu yehlehleh na a ŋoh ma aki nga agohsoh amoh, dehreh za a nati a nati a lisa amboh ata nza ma a shimba kpa kpeh reh mata a bu na kpakpana kpeh ma aki nga agohsoh ika wohroh za. <verse eid="ROM 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />nehnehreh neh meh nati kǝ gu akpi reh tavoh ma ikpi nga agohsoh? Mbimbi kpeh!<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Nga Agohsoh Ibrahim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />A bu umbo meh nati kǝ bleh ma ikpi Ibrahim, ŋoh nza a bu Ada Adada ambohroh mboh ata itoh reh? Umbo tana a bu nza a ŋoh? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Bu tama a bleh la, Ibrahim reh a lisa yehlehleh ma tohmoh Nnoh na awumu ata ŋoh nza a lisa reh, bu Ibrahim tana a wina ava ivoh ma agohsoh ma ikpi wohroh na kyangwri mboh, neh ta a bu ma tohmoh Nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />Amgbasho reh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ibrahim tana sa tsifa Nnoh reh a kira, tasa tsifa nga agohsoh a ŋoh reh, Nnoh a sa ŋoh tswanza kyangwri ata nza a tufa yehlehleh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Kyangwri ata nza a te ndohmoh ma a nati a fanga ŋoh firoh, firoh a ŋoh reh neh a nati a bu ngǝnga ata wusu kpeh, a nati a bu firoh ndohmoh a ŋoh mi. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Kyangwri ata nza a gya agohsoh a ŋoh na ndohmoh a ŋoh kpeh, ŋoh neh ka sa tsifa Nnoh ata ka a lisa agugu mboh mata tufa yehlehleh, ma a nati a gu nga agohsoh kyangwri wohroh ta a bu ŋoh tswanza a tufa yehlehleh. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Dehreh za Dawuda a bleh tsifa te atoh ata nza ma a lisa ma kyangwri ata Nnoh nza a gu ŋoh la ka a tufa yehlehleh reh, a bu ma ikpi ndohmoh ata kyangwri reh nza a lisa reh kpeh:<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />&lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na kyangwri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">ata nza ma a te kohhroh na kpakpana a ŋoh mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">ata nza ma a hama kpakpana amoh mboh,<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />Te atoh a bu na kyangwri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:8">ata Ada nza a sohroh a bleh kpakpana a ŋoh mboh reh kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Te atoh ata areh a bu ata amboh shimba kpa mboh tsimoh, ha a bu ata amboh shimba kpa kpeh za? Andromboh ata Mbohroh nza meh bleh nyi nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh a bu la, &lt;&lt;Ibrahim tana a nga agohsoh na Nnoh, tasa za tana a bu tsifa nga agohsoh a ŋoh, Nnoh a gu ŋoh la ŋoh bu kyangwri ata ka a tufa yehlehleh. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />Tana a bu na ameh atamaa tama ka a gu ŋoh la ŋoh bu kyangwri tufa yehlehleh reh? Tana a bu na ameh ata ma a hehreh shimba kpa a ŋoh kpeh reh, ha neh tama shimba kpa a ŋoh reh na ameh wohroh? Tama a hehreh shimba kpa a ŋoh reh na ameh wohroh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Shimba kpa a ŋoh reh tana bu kpra, ata nza a tsana la ŋoh reh a tufa yehlehleh, ma ikpi nga agohsoh ata ta ka a bu na wohroh neh ma a hehreh a shimba ŋoh kpa reh kpeh. Nza ka a bu dehreh, Ibrahim ka bu Ada amboh ata nza ma sa tsifa Nnoh a kira reh, mboh neh ma a hehreh a shimba mboh kpa kpeh, mboh za mata a fi mboh nimeh amboh tufa yehlehleh. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />Tasa Ibrahim za tana a bu Ada amboh ata nza ma a shimba mboh kpanda, tana a bu shimba kpa ma tsene ma a bu na wohroh kpeh, mboh neh tama a leh a tufa biroh nga agohsoh ata Ibrahim ta ka a bu na wohroh feh ma sa a shimba ŋoh kpanda reh.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Andromboh Ata Nnoh Nza A bleh A gya Reh Ma A nati A sa Ma Aki Nga Agohsoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Andromboh ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya ma Ibrahim tasa alohsoh a ŋoh mboh reh la ŋoh a nati a rya gohmoh inziyo reh, ŋoh tana a lisa dehreh, tsifa la Ibrahim tana a sa akpi reh a tufa yehlehleh kpeh, tana bu tsifa nga agohsoh a ŋoh ma Nnoh, a bu wohroh Nnoh nza a sa ŋoh la ŋoh bu kyangwri tufa yehlehleh reh. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Nza andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh ma a nati a nga amboh ata nza ma a tufa akpi ma reh, nza a bu dehreh, nga agohsoh kyangwri a nati a bu andromboh kpeh tasa za andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh a nati a bu wusu ma. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Akpi Musa reh a nati a de gofo Nnoh a tamba a ba, atsi ata neh akpi nza a yama kpeh reh, sa tsifa leke za a nati a yama kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Nza a bu dehreh, a bu tsifa ata Mbohroh nza meh nga agohsoh ma Nnoh reh meh nati sa andromboh ata nza ma a bleh a gya reh, tsifa la andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh, mata a nga ma alohsoh Ibrahim mboh reh nambri, a nati a bu na amboh ata nza ma a tufa akpi reh ma tsene kpeh, a nati a bu na amboh ata za neh nza ma nga agohsoh amoh tswanza Ibrahim ta ka a lisa reh. Ibrahim reh a bu Ada ambohroh ata huru nambri; <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh seh nnoh ti bu ada vara kyangwri mboh ma inziyo areh.&gt;&gt;La ma a kira na andromboh ata nza a bu bleh gyaa reh. Ibrahim bu ada ambohroh ma tohmoh Nnoh ata nza a kira na a ŋoh, ata ŋoh za a bu akyo ata ka a nga fene ma amboh kwo mboh, tasa a bu ŋoh za ka a bleh la awumu amboh ata nza ma a yama kpeh reh la mata a kate a yama. <verse eid="ROM 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ibrahim tana sa tsifa reh a kira tasa za tana a gya agohsoh za, ŋoh reh ma tana a bu na andromboh ata nza a nati a nga ŋoh gya agohsoh reh kpeh, ŋoh reh ka a leh a gya agohsoh ta ka bu &lt;&lt;Ada vara kyangwri mboh ma inziyo areh.&gt;&gt; Tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho reh la, &lt;&lt;Alohsoh anzoh mboh ma a nati a bu gaga tswanza akpukpa mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />Na ameh wohroh reh ahushi Ibrahim tana bu agrumavoh ida agrumavoh, nga agohsoh a ŋoh neh a sohroh anyinana kpeh, ameh ata achoh ta ka a ba ŋoh tasa za kǝ ba whiri ta a gu itoh a ŋoh a tavoh, a wina za la afiya a ŋoh Saratu a nati a za a wina mara za kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Nga agohsoh a ŋoh reh a sohroh ata ŋoh kpeh, tasa za a sohroh a chi aniye na andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh kpeh, nga agohsoh a ŋoh reh a lisa a nga ŋoh wuwana, tasa za a ka a leh riri Nnoh. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />Ibrahim tana a wina la Nnoh reh a nati a wina lisa andromboh ata ŋoh ta ka a bleh a gya la ŋoh wa a nati a lisa reh. <verse eid="ROM 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22" />A bu tsifa nga agohsoh Ibrahim reh, &lt;&lt;Nnoh tana a gu la ŋoh bu kyangwri tufa yehlehleh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23" />Tsifa la, &lt;&lt;tama a sa ŋoh tswanza kyangwri tufa yehlehleh reh&gt;&gt; tama a ŋa tsifa reh ma ikpi a ŋoh tsene kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />Tama a ŋa tsifa reh tsifa ambohroh za, Mbohroh amboh ata Nnoh nza a gu reh la meh bu amboh tufa yehlehleh reh, mbohroh amboh ata nza meh nga agohsoh na akyo ata nza a yiri Yeso Ada ambohroh anyi ma kwo reh. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />A bu tsifa kpakpana ambohroh mboh reh ŋa nza ma a gu Yeso la ta a kwo reh, tasa za ma a gyuru a yiri ŋoh na fene la Mbohroh meh ti za bu amboh kpakpana mboh za kpeh ma tohmoh Nnoh.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yelele Na Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />nehnehreh mbohroh meh kǝ bu amboh tufa yehlehleh ma tohmoh Nnoh, ma aki nga agohsoh ambohroh. Meh bu na tuma alindeh na Nnoh ma aki tufa Ada ambohroh Yeso kristi. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />Ŋoh kǝ wa reh ba meh ti hunji lisa alindeh ata Nnoh, ma aki nga agohsoh ata nza meh bu nimeh reh, Tasa mbohroh meh va ivoh ma agohsoh na gya agohsoh ambohroh ma ikpi hunji nga agba ata Nnoh reh. <verse eid="ROM 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Mbohroh meh johjoh ma ikpi wa iya ambohroh reh, tsifa la mbohroh meh wina la iya ambohroh reh a ka nga reh meh ti wina de ikpi ahroh wuwa, <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />de ikpi ahroh wuwa a ka de agohsoh alindeh a ba, agohsoh alindeh a de gya agohsoh a ba. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Gya agohsoh ata areh a ka nga na sa kpeh, Nnoh a were kira a ŋoh nimeh agohsoh ambohroh ma aki Huru zanana ata Nnoh nza nga reh.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Na ameh ata timi kǝ hehreh wina shingi ikpi ambohroh kpeh reh, a bu Kristi tana a kwo tsifa ambohroh, mbohroh nza meh bu ma agohsoh Nnoh kpeh reh. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />A nati bu na iya la akyo ta a kwo ma ikpi kyangwri ata nza ka tufa aki yehlehleh. Handuhwa akyo a nati wina bleh la ŋoh a nati wina wuwa agohsoh ta a kwo tsifa kyangwri lisa agohsoh alindeh. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Nnoh neh kǝ tsana reh gaga la ŋoh a kira na ambohroh, ta a bu na ameh neh Mbohroh ma tre bu amboh kpakpana mboh la Almasihu a kwo tsifa ambohroh! <verse eid="ROM 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Na kwo a ŋoh reh maka a de reh a te amboh tufa yehlehleh mboh ma aki Nnoh; neh, ma aki ŋoh ma a nati a sa reh a hwana nyi ma gofo Nnoh! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Mbohroh timi gu Nnoh reh fi ma tohmoh, ŋoh neh ka suhru reh a ba na a ŋoh ma aki kwo Amehreh a ŋoh. Nehnehreh nza meh bu iziza Nnoh mboh, neh ma a nati a sa a hwa na na fene Kristi! <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Bu wohroh tsene kpeh; meh johjoh tsifa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa tsifa Ada ambohroh Kristi reh, ata nza a de reh a te iziza a ŋoh mboh.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adamu Tasa Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />Tswanza kyangwri anyimbehreh nza a de kpakpana a ba ma inziyo, kpakpana reh ka a de kwo a ba, ma aki wohroh kwo reh ka awo kyangwri mboh ma inziyo nambri, kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka a bu na kpakpana. <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Kpakpana tana a jiji a yama ma inziyo feh masa a de tsana amgbasho Musa reh a ba; neh maka a bleh tsifa kpakpana kpeh ma atsi ata amgbasho Musa a yama kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Ka a bu dehreh neh nza ka a gu anyi na ameh Adamu a gu a ba a te na Musa, kwo ka a tuma ma ikpi kyangwri mboh nambri, tasa ma ikpi amboh nza ma a sohroh kpakpana kpeh ika ata Adamu ta ka a wuwa ikpi ma Nnoh reh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Adamu reh neh tana a bu kpra akyo ata nza a nati ba reh. <verse eid="ROM 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Na afri ma amoh neh ma a tswana kpeh, tsifa la, ngǝnga ata Nnoh reh a sohroh a tswanza kpakpana adamu reh kpeh. A bu zizi la kyangwri mboh gaga ma a kwo tsifa kpakpana kyangwri anyimbehreh wohroh. Lisa alindeh Nnoh reh neh a keh gaga, tasa a ka a bu ngǝnga were ma kyangwri mboh gaga ma aki a lisa alindeh ata kyangwri anyimbehreh, Yeso Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Ngǝnga ata Nnoh a bu tse na kpakpana kyangwri anyimbehreh reh. Hwra akpi ata nza a tufa nyina kpakpana anyimbehreh ata areh reh neh ka a bu &lt;&lt;Kpakpana&gt;&gt;; neh inyina kpakpana mboh gaga reh, meh kǝ hunji hwra akpi ngǝnga ata nza a bu na &lt;&lt;Kpakpana kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />A bu zizi la bu ma aki kyangwri anyimbehreh kwo ka a bu ti de kyangwri mboh tsifa kyangwri anyimbehreh wohroh. de kpra kwo ma ikpi kyangwri mboh reh a bu andromboh kpeh, nza la mata a tsara ŋoh na ata kyangwri anyimbehreh, ata Yeso kristi nza a de a ba ma amboh ata nza ma a sa lisa alindeh Nnoh tasa ti hende yehlehleh were na a ŋoh a nati de kpra ma inziyo ma aki tufa kristi.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Wohroh Nnoh nza nga iya ma kyangwri mboh nambri tsifa kpakpana anyimbehreh wohroh ata Adamu nza na a lisa. Andromboh anyimbehreh ata Kristi nza a lisa neh a ka a sa kyangwri mboh a hwana ta ka nga mboh fene. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Tswanza kyangwri mboh nambri maka a tuma amboh kpakpana mboh ma aki wuwa ikpi kyangwri anyimbehreh, ma aki wohroh za kyangwri mboh gaga ma a nati bu amboh lisa yehlehleh ma aki nga agba ma kyangwri anyimbehreh.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Amgbasho Musa ta ka aniye a ba reh bu tsifa la kyangwri mboh mata a nza la kpakpana amoh reh wa a lisa a keh gaga, kpakpana nza ka a lisa a keh reh neh, Lisa alindeh Nnoh ka a lisa a keh gaga. <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />Dehreh neh avoh tswanza kpakpana nza ka a de kyangwri mboh ma aki a mla mboh kwo, a bu avoh dehreh za Nnoh ka a de kyangwri mboh ma aki lisa yehlehleh ta a wa reh a na meh ti hunji fene ata tuma atono ma aki Yeso Kristi Ada ambohroh.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Kwo Ma Kpakpana Fene Nimeh Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Meh nati bleh la umbo za? meh kǝ rya tohmoh na hende nimeh kpakpana reh la lisa alindeh Nnoh ta a lisa a keh? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Uwa, a nati a mishi a bu dehreh kpeh! timi kwo ma kpakpana, a zohhoh meh ti rya tohmoh nimeh kpakpana kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Ni wina noh la ti kǝ wra nnoh batisma nimeh dohsoh ikpi na Kristi Yeso, timi wra batisma nimeh dohsoh ikpi na kwo a ŋoh. <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Wra batisma ambohroh reh a tsana la, tama anyifo reh ma a ŋoh a bu avoh tswanza timi kwo ma a ŋoh reh za, a bu tswanza ta maka a yiri Kristi a hinga nyi ma kwo na wuwana agba ata Ada reh, a bu dehreh za la handuhwa meh ti hende nimeh fene afeh.<verse eid="ROM 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Tswanza nza meh kǝ bu anyimbehreh ma a ŋoh nimeh kwo ata nza a lisa reh, ma aki wohroh meh nati bu anyimbehreh ma a ŋoh ma aki hinga nza ma a yiri ŋoh a ba fene reh tswanza ta ka a bu reh. <verse eid="ROM 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Meh wina la itoh ambohroh ata atono reh tama a gu a kohhroh mboh ma Kristi ma gbohrohgboh, la mata a mla wuwana itoh ata kpakpana reh kwo, la meh ti za bu ahwra ma kpakpana kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Nza meh kwo ma a sa reh a hwana nyi ma wuwana kpakpana. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Tswanza nza meh kwo ma Kristi reh, meh nga agohsoh la meh nati nvara ma a ŋoh za. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Mbohroh meh wina la tama a yiri Kristi anyi ma kwo tasa a nati a mishi a kwo za kpeh, kwo a za a bu na wuwana ma ikpi a ŋoh za kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Kwo ata nza a lisa reh a kwo hwana anyimbehreh, kwo a bu na wuwana ma ikpi a ŋoh kpeh; tasa nehnehreh fene a ŋoh anvara nimeh dohsoh ikpi na Nnoh. <verse eid="ROM 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />mohnoh za kohnoh nnoh ikpi amohnoh ma aki anyimbehreh. Kwo a bu na wuwana ma ikpi amohnoh kpeh, tswanza ni kwo nnoh reh, nimeh fene amohnoh afeh reh, nvara nnoh ti krumusu Nnoh, tsifa la ni tufa nnoh Kristi Yeso. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Kama kira nnoh kpakpana ta a za a de itoh amohnoh ata nza a nati kwo reh kpeh, la ti tufa aki ata agugu kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Kama kira iba itoh anzoh anyi ta a de noh a te ahwra ma kpakpana kpeh, ma aki lisa ndohmoh ata nza bu yehlehleh kpeh. Neh, nga nnoh ikpi amohnoh ma Nnoh tswanza amboh nza ma a sa mboh a hwana nyi ma kwo a ba ma aki hunji fene, nga nnoh ikpi amohnoh ma Nnoh ma aki tufa yehlehleh. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Kpakpana a nati bu Agohmoh ma ikpi amohnoh kanga kpeh; mohnoh ni za bu noh ma ivoh akpi reh kpeh, tsana amgbasho Musa reh kpeh, neh ni bu noh ma ivoh lisa alindeh Nnoh.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahwra Ma Aki Tufa yehlehleh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />Ka a nati bu lele? feh, meh nati kǝ kpakpana, tsifa la Mbohroh nza meh bu ma ivoh amgbasho Musa reh kpeh, neh ta ka a bu lisa alindeh Nnoh reh ma? Uwa, mbimbi kpeh! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Kohnoh nza noh la nza ni kira ti te nnoh ahwra ma akyo ni nati nga nnoh agba ma akyo reh, ha bu kpakpana, ata ka a de kwo a ba reh, ha nga agba ma Nnoh ata nza a bu tufa yehlehleh. <verse eid="ROM 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Neh, meh nga kwende ma Nnoh la, ni kiri tini bu noh ahwra ma kpakpana, nehnehreh neh ni kǝ nga nnoh agohsoh amohnoh anyimbehreh na biroh tsana ata nza ma a tsana noh reh. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Tama a sa noh a hwana nyi ma kpakpana ti kǝ bu noh ahwra ma aki tufa yehlehleh. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Meh tsifa na amohnoh na mgba lomo tsifa kyangwri mboh, tsifa la ni nyinana nnoh nimeh lomo ata kyangwri mboh. Na ameh anyi tini gu ikpi amohnoh te nnoh ahwra ata awumu arishi, tasa ndohmoh agugu. Ma aki wohroh za ni nati gu nnoh ikpi amohnoh ti bu noh ahwra ata tufa yehlehleh ata nza bu zana na na Nnoh.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Na ameh ata ti kǝ bu noh ahwra ma kpakpana reh, tama a sa noh a hwana nyi ma aki tufa yehlehleh. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Ni hunji noh mboh alindeh nyi nnoh ma ikpi andromboh mboh nza ni lisa ata nehnehreh a te nnoh na sa? trina a ŋoh a nati bu kwo. <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Nehnehreh neh maka a sa noh a hwana anyi ma ivoh kpakpana ti kǝ bu noh ahwra mboh ma Nnoh. Ni hunji noh firoh fene ata a gu nnoh a na ti hunji noh fene ata tuma atono. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Firoh kpakpana a bu kwo; ngǝnga were ata Nnoh neh a bu fene ata tuma atono ma aki dohsoh ikpi na Kristi Yeso Ada ambohroh.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Tsana Ma Ikpi Sa Afiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />ambohroh mboh mohnoh Ni wina tsifa akpi reh, ni wina noh andromboh ata mya nza ni nati bleh reh. tsana ata areh a ka a de akyo ata nza a bu na fene ma tsene. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Nza Afya neh ata nza a bu na atsifa akpi reh a ka a de ŋoh a dohdohsoh na atsifa a ŋoh, nza atsifa a ŋoh reh a treh bu na fene; nza neh a ka a kwo, akpi tuma atsifa reh a za a de ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Nza ka a na na a tuma na akyo anyi neh atsifa reh a treh a bu na fene, ma a nati a fi ŋoh la a bu afya hende leh ahohndoh na akyo mboh; nza atsifa a ŋoh reh neh kǝ kwo, akpi reh kǝ hingrena ta ŋoh avoh, a za a nati a bu afya akyo za kpeh, tasa za a nati hende leh ahohndoh na akyo mboh za kpeh nza tana a sa atsifa anyi reh.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Iziza amya amboh, mohnoh za ni bu noh dehreh, Na ameh ata itoh Yeso ta ka a kwo ma gbohrohgboh reh, tini dohsoh ikpi na a ŋoh. a tswanza la tini kwo nnoh ma a ŋoh reh, ni zi bu noh ma ivoh akpi reh kpeh. Nehnehreh ni bu noh na aki ti tufa nnoh aki anyi tse. Ni bu noh ata Kristi, ata Nnoh nza a yiri ŋoh nyi kwo. A bu tsifa wohroh, meh nati nvara ma aki alindeh ata nza a nati nga Nnoh nana yira. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Nza meh hende na mgba agohsoh kyangwri, akpi tana a de kohnoh abibi mboh a ba reh ma agohsoh ambohroh mboh. Tsifa wohroh, itoh ambohroh reh ka a nati a de reh a te meh ti kpakpana gaga. Ma trina ŋoh ka a nati bu kwo. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Nehnehreh meh za bu ma ivoh akpi reh kpeh tsifa la timi kwo ma andromboh ata ta ka a lafa reh a gya reh. Tsifa la nehnehreh meh buti te ndohmoh ma Nnoh nimeh huru a ŋoh afeh. Aki tufa ambohroh atono reh kǝ gǝga ata ma ta ka a ŋa ma amgbasho Musa reh.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akpi Musa tasa Kpakpana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Areh meh kǝ bleh la, akpi reh na ikpi a ŋoh a bu kpakpana? Uwa! Neh tana a bu akpi reh ŋa nza a te mya nza wina tsifa kpakpana reh. bu Akpi Musa reh bu tama a sohroh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kama te iyo ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a bu anzoh kpeh,&gt;&gt; Bu timi sohroh wina andromboh la te iyo kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Neh ka a bu tsifa doka ŋoh reh ŋa kpakpana ka a hunji avoh a gǝga aniye a na na a de kohnoh te iyo ma atsetse a ba ameh. Ma a bu akpi reh kpeh, bu kpakpana ma a yama kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Na kiri reh neh mya meh tini bu na fene, na ameh ata neh meh sohroh wina na tsifa akpi reh kpeh; doka nza ka a ba reh neh, kpakpana ka a hunji wuwana na fene amya, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />tasa meh kǝ kwo. Doka reh tana a ba la ta a de fene a ba reh, neh ka a gyuru a de kwo a ba. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Akpi Musa reh ka nga aki ma kpakpana aki ta a landa meh. meh kǝ kwo tsifa doka reh.<verse eid="ROM 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Akpi Musa reh na ikpi a ŋoh a zanana, tasa doka reh a zanana, a bu yehlehleh, tasa a zohhoh.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Akyo a nati a bleh la, ha a bu andromboh alindeh ata areh ŋa nza a de kwo a ba reh? Uwa mbimbi kyar kpeh! a bu ma aki tsana ata nza a zohhoh reh kpakpana a de kwo a ba meh, la mata a tsana la ha kpakpana a ka bu lele. Wohroh ka bu doka ata kpakpana nza a kate ma inziyo na abibi a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">keh Na Aniye Ma Kpakpana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Meh wina ata areh, la akpi Musa reh a bu andromboh ata huru. Mya neh meh bu na agohsoh ata kyangwri, meh bu ahwra ma ivoh kpakpana ma wusu. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Meh sohroh wina andromboh ata mya nza ni lisa reh kpeh, ata mya nza ni kira meh ti lisa reh, a bu wohroh meh kǝ sohroh lisa kpeh, tasa andromboh ata mya nza ni sohroh kira lisa ŋoh kpeh reh, a bu wohroh meh kǝ lisa. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Nza a bu andromboh ata mya nza kǝ kira lisa reh, ka bu wohroh mya meh kǝ lisa kpeh, mya meh kira la akpi reh a zohhoh. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Wohroh la, ka a bu mya na ikpi amya meh kǝ lisa andromboh reh kpeh, a ka a bu kpakpana ata nza aniye a tuma nimeh itoh amya reh. <verse eid="ROM 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Mya meh wina la andromboh ata nza a zohhoh reh a mishi a yama nimeh itoh amya kpeh, nimeh agohsoh amya ata kyangwri. Nza mya meh kira meh ti lisa andromboh ata nza a bu alindeh reh, lisa dehreh reh neh ka a keh wuwana amya. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Meh kǝ sohroh lisa agohsoh alindeh ika ata mya nza ni kira meh ti lisa reh kpeh, Mya neh meh kǝ lisa agohsoh agugu ata mya nza kǝ kira meh ti lisa reh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Neh, nza meh kǝ lisa andromboh ata mya nza meh kira lisa ŋoh kpeh reh, areh a tsana la a bu mya mi meh kǝ lisa andromboh wohroh kpeh, neh a ka a bu kpakpana ata nza a bu nimeh amya reh.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Neh meh kǝ nza la, akpi a bu ti te ndohmoh; nza meh kira la meh ti lisa andromboh ata nza a zohhoh reh, neh meh kǝ nza la agugu reh ata meh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Nza a bu nimeh agohsoh amya, meh kira na akpi Nnoh reh. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Mya neh meh gyuru nza akpi afeh anyi atsi te ndohmoh nimeh itoh amya, akpi wohroh reh a leh a mla na na akpi ata mya nza ni kira reh. A lafa meh tswanza ahwra ata kpakpana ata nza a leh a te ndohmoh nimeh itoh amya reh. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Ata areh nga meh hungwa agohsoh! Itoh amya a nati a wa meh a na atsi kwo. Meh fa akyo ata nza a nati a sa meh a hwana anyi na wuwana ata kpakpana ata itoh reh. <verse eid="ROM 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Meh kwende ma Nnoh ata nza a sa meh a hwana, ma ikpi andromboh ata Yeso Kristi nza a lisa reh. Nza bu dehreh reh mya na ikpi amya meh nati te ndohmoh Nnoh na agohsoh amya, kohnoh ata kyangwri reh neh meh nati leh krumusu akpi ata kpakpana ma.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">Tuma Nimeh Huru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Nehnehreh Lofona a yama kpeh na amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh Kristi Yeso reh. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Nza ni bu nna Yeso Kristi reh, Huru Nnoh reh a nati a nga noh fene afeh, Huru zanana reh a nati a de fene anzoh tasa za ta a sa noh a hwana. Kpakpana tasa kwo a nati a bu na wuwana ma ikpi anzoh za kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" />Andromboh ata akpi nza a wina lisa kpeh reh, tsifa la kyangwri tana a bu na wuwana kpeh, Nnoh tana a lisa. A nasa kpakpana kyangwri ma aki tohmoh Amehreh a ŋoh, ata nza a ba tswanza kyangwri kpakpana ta a ba ba a hwara kpakpana ambohroh mboh. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />Nnoh a lisa dehreh tsifa la ndohmoh alindeh mboh reh tasa tsana ata nza ma a bleh la mata a lisa reh ta a su na ambohroh, Mbohroh nza meh bu na kohnoh ika ata kyangwri mboh reh kpeh, a bu kohnoh ata huru ma. <verse eid="ROM 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />amboh ata nza ma a bu na agohsoh ika ata kyangwri mboh reh, maka a gu kohnoh amoh a fi a na na kohnoh ata itoh. amboh ata nza ma a bu na kohnoh ata huru reh, maka a gu agohsoh amoh a fi a na na andromboh ata Huru nza a kira reh. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />amboh ata nza ma a keh kira na kohnoh ata ikpi amoh reh, ma a nati kwo, kyangwri amboh ata neh nza ma a kohnoh ma ikpi Huru zanana ata Nnoh nza a kira reh ma a nati a bu na fene na Nnoh. Ma a nati a bu na tuma alindeh nimeh amoh. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Kyangwri ma a nati a fi Nnoh ma tohmoh, nza ma a bu na kohnoh ata ikpi amoh reh; ma a sohroh a tufa akpi Nnoh reh kpeh, tasa ma a zizi ma a nati a wina tufa akpi Nnoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Kyangwri amboh ata nza ma nga kira na kohnoh ata itoh reh, ma a nati a wina lisa andromboh la Nnoh ta a nza nana amoh kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />mohnoh neh ni sohroh tuma noh na biroh itoh kyangwri kpeh, ni bu noh amboh tuma Huru ata Nnoh mi, nza la Huru Nnoh a buti tuma ma agohsoh amohnoh reh. Akyo ata nza a bu na Huru Kristi kpeh, a sohroh bu Kristi a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Nza neh Kristi a buti tuma nimeh anzoh, Huru reh a bu fene na anzoh, tsifa la maka a de noh a fi ma aki tufa yehlehleh na Nnoh, meh wina la itoh amohnoh mboh a nati kwo tsifa kpakpana. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Nza neh Huru Nnoh reh, ata nza a yiri Yeso anyi ma kwo, a buti tuma nimeh amohnoh, neh ŋoh akyo wohroh nza a yiri Kristi anyi ma kwo reh a nati a nga fene ma itoh amohnoh ata nza a nati kwo reh ma aki Huru a ŋoh ata nza a tuma nimeh agohsoh amohnoh mboh reh.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Tsifa wohroh dehreh neh, ambohroh mboh, ndohmoh a yama meh ikpi, neh la meh ti sohroh tuma tswanza itoh ambohroh ata kyangwri nza a kira la meh ti bu reh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Nza la ni tuma noh na mgba itoh kyangwri, ni nati kwo nnoh; nza neh ka a bu na mgba Huru ni kǝ yi kpakpana anzoh mboh nza ni kǝ lisa reh ta, ni nati bu na fene. <verse eid="ROM 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />amboh ata Huru Nnoh nza a wa mboh a tsana aki reh, ma a bu mara Nnoh mboh. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Huru ata Nnoh a nga noh reh a bu la ta a de noh a te ahwra kpeh ha la ta ti nyiri nnoh kpeh; neh la Huru reh ta a de noh a te mara Nnoh mi, tasa la nimeh wuwana Huru reh meh kpanga kate na ni Nnoh, &lt;&lt;Abba! Ada amya!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Huru Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh a dohsohna na ambohroh ta ka a bleh la mbohroh meh bu mara Nnoh mboh mi. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Tsifa la Mbohroh meh bu mara mboh reh, meh nati hunji awumu alilehndeh mboh nyi na a ŋoh. Awumu amboh ata ŋoh ta ka a bleh reh a gya la ŋoh a nati nga ma mara a ŋoh mboh, tasa Kristi meh nati sa andromboh ata Nnoh ta ka a gya ŋoh reh; A bu zizi la nza meh kira meh ti gu vari tswanza Kristi nza a gu reh, neh meh nati kǝ johjoh ma inza tswanza Kristi za nza lisa agbugba awumu mboh a gya ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agba Ata Nza A bu Ma Tomwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Mya nza la na ameh ata nehnehreh, andromboh ata meh buti wa iya ma ikpi a ŋoh reh, meh nati mishi tsara na agba ata nza a nati a vuru a tsana reh reh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Inziyo nambri ma a tuma a bana Nnoh ta tsana mara a ŋoh mboh reh. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20" />Awumu amboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa mboh reh tama a lofo mboh la mata a zohhoh za kpeh, a bu na kira a ŋoh kpeh, neh ka a bu tsifa la ŋoh Nnoh a kira la ta a bu dehreh. Dehreh za gya agohsoh tana a yama, <verse eid="ROM 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21" />la awumu amboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa reh, ma a nati a hunji nvara amoh anyi na ahwra a ŋoh ta a hwina, tasa za ma a nati a hunji tuma ikpi amoh nza bu agba reh, ata ma a nati a lisa ma mara Nnoh mboh. <verse eid="ROM 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Mbohroh meh wina la nza ka a gu anyi avoh ameh a gu a ba a te nehnehreh, lisa Nnoh mboh ma a kpanga a rinana, tswanza kpanga rinana mara. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Neh a bu lisa Nnoh tsene nza ma a kpanga a goh reh kpeh; Mbohroh amboh ata nza meh bu na Huru tswanza a bu ngǝnga ata Nnoh ata jiji ŋoh reh za ma kpanga goh ma itoh ambohroh, tswanza la ma a bana la Nnoh ta a wa reh a te mara a ŋoh mboh ta kyangwri mboh nambri mata anvara. <verse eid="ROM 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Ta a bu na gya agohsoh mi nza ma a nga reh nvara. Neh nza Mbohroh meh kǝ nza andromboh ata nza gya agohsoh ma ikpi ŋoh, wohroh, a za bu gya agohsoh kpeh. A bu anyi kyangwri a ka a gya agohsoh na andromboh ata ŋoh nza kǝ jiji bu na wohroh? <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Neh nza meh gya agohsoh ma ikpi andromboh ata mbohroh nza meh sohroh hunji kpeh, bana turoh na soh ivoh yira.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Ma aki wohroh Huru za a ka a ba ta a shingi reh meh ti lisa hunji wuwana, Mbohroh meh sohroh wina meh ti shi kwere Nnoh kpeh; Huru reh na ikpi a ŋoh a ka a shi ta a kwere Nnoh ma ikpi ambohroh na kpanga rinana ta ka a bleh yohroh tsifa mboh ata aniye a nati wina bleh tre ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Tasa Nnoh, ŋoh nza ka a nza nimeh agohsoh ambohroh a wina andromboh ata kohnoh Huru nza a bu; tsifa la Huru reh a ka a leh a kwere Nnoh aniye na kyangwri a ŋoh mboh tasa ma anene tsifa Nnoh reh.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Mbohroh meh wina la nimeh awumu mboh nambri Nnoh a lisa ajija ndohmoh mboh na kohnoh alindeh na amboh ata nza ma a kira na a ŋoh, amboh ata ŋoh nza a fi mboh ma anene tsifa a ŋoh mboh reh. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />amboh ata Nnoh ta ka a jiji a seh mboh ta ka a fira mboh a gya mata a gu tohmoh Amehreh a ŋoh, la ta a bu ata jitomo nimeh ambohroh mboh nimeh alohsoh amboh ata a gaga ŋoh. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Amboh ata Nnoh nza a fira mboh a gya a bu mboh mi ka a fi mboh. amboh ata ŋoh nza a fi mboh reh, a bu mboh mi maka a bu yehlehleh na a ŋoh, tasa za ka a gafa nga agba a ŋoh reh ma amoh.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kira Nnoh Nimeh Kristi Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Nimeh amboh areh nambri, meh kǝ nati bleh la mboh? Nza Nnoh a bu na ambohroh, Bu anyi ka nati a wina shi reh tohmoh? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Nnoh neh a sohroh a ha reh Amehreh a ŋoh kpeh, neh ka a gu ŋoh a nga reh nambri ma ambohroh. ŋoh Nnoh ata nza a nga reh Amehreh a ŋoh reh a nati a wina nga reh mgbiri awumu ivoh mboh nambri na agohsoh a ŋoh anyimbehreh kpeh? <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ba anyi a nati a ŋa kyangwri mboh amboh ata Nnoh nza a seh mboh? bu Nnoh na ikpi a ŋoh a wa a te amboh ata nza ma a bu na kpakpana kpeh ma tohmoh! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Bu anyi a tswa ta ahwra akpi kwo ma kyangwri? Nza ta a bu Kristi Yeso kpeh, ata nza a kwo, ha neh, ata ta ka a yiri a ba fene tasa ata nza a tuma na mgba ivoh rya kpa Nnoh, ka a kwere ŋoh ma ikpi ambohroh! <verse eid="ROM 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Bu anyi a tswa ta gafa reh na kira ata Kristi nza ka a lisa reh? A bu wa iya abibi, ha fi akpi, ha mata a nga reh iya, ha bu inyo, ha iya hungroh, ha ti kpa hwana hwa, ha kwo? <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Tswanza amgbasho Nnoh nza a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">&lt;&lt;Ikpi tsifa amohnoh kwo ka a fi reh tohmoh na tutu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">Ma a gu reh tswanza meh bu atashi mboh ata nza ma a wa a na atsi fa<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Uwa, nimeh awumu mboh nambri Mbohroh meh gǝga mata a bleh reh tsifa rya tohmoh ma, areh neh ka anyi na ŋoh ata nza kira na ambohroh mi! <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38" />Meh wina za la andromboh anyi a nati gafa reh na kira a ŋoh kpeh ha kwo ha fene, ha amehreh tohmoh Nnoh, ha mgbiri amboh de kpra Agohmoh ata inza mboh ha wuwana mboh, ha ata nehnehreh ha amboh ata ma a bu ma tohmoh, <verse eid="ROM 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39" />ha inziyo ata inza ha inziyo ata nza a bu ma inzi andromboh anyi a mishi a yama ata Nnoh nza a lisa ata nza a nati a wina gafa reh anyi na kira Nnoh ata nza a bu ambohroh nimeh Kristi Yeso Ada ambohroh.<verse eid="ROM 8:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Nnoh Tasa Kyangwri amboh ata ŋoh Nza A seh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Mya meh leh bleh zizi nimeh Kristi, a bu huru tsifa meh leh bleh kpeh. Kohnoh ma agohsoh alindeh amya reh, ata huru zanana nza a tsana meh reh, a tsana meh zizi za la <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />meh bu na hungwa agohsoh gaga, tasa kohnoh na tutu nimeh agohsoh amya <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />tsifa kyangwri amya mboh, itoh amya tasa imiya! A bu tsifa amoh bu mya tini kira na ikpi amya la, meh ti bu ma hohroh a kya Nnoh, mata a ha meh na ni Kristi. <verse eid="ROM 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />amboh wohroh reh ma bu Israilawa mboh, a bu mboh amboh wohroh ata Nnoh nza a de mboh la ma bu mara a ŋoh mboh reh, a tsana mboh agba a ŋoh, tasa za atsifa bleh gya na amoh za, a nga mboh akpi reh za, tasa za ma a bu na krumusu ata nza bu zizi reh, maka a sa awumu ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya la ŋoh wa a nati a nga mboh reh. <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />Mboh reh tama anyi na adada amya mboh amboh ata nza ma a wina mboh gaga reh, ŋoh Kristi za nza anyi nimeh itoh kyangwri reh, tana bu alohsoh amoh. Riri reh ta bu Nnoh a ŋoh ata nza a de awumu mboh reh nambri ata tuma atono. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Mya reh meh sohroh bleh la andromboh ata Nnoh nza a bleh a gya reh a nati a su kpeh. A bu kyangwri Israila mboh nambri nza ma bu kyangwri Nnoh mboh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Tasa za a bu amboh ata nza ma anyi nimeh alohsoh Ibrahim mboh nza ma a bu mara Ibrahim mboh ata a zizi reh kpeh. Nnoh tana a bleh ma Ibrahim la, &lt;&lt;A bu ma aki Ishaku ŋa ma a nati a leh a rya tohmoh na fi alohsoh anzoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ata areh a tsana la a bu amehreh amboh ata nza a mara mboh ma itoh nza ma a bu mara Nnoh mboh kpeh reh, mara amboh ata neh nza ma a mara mboh ma aki ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya reh, mboh reh ma bu mara Ibrahim mboh ata a zizi. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Ata areh a bu tsifa ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh a gya ma Ibrahim reh: &lt;&lt;Nza ameh wohroh a nati a su reh, meh nati gyuru ba, Saratu a nati a mara amehreh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />A bu ata areh ma tsene kpeh, mara Rifkatu mboh na afri ma amoh alehmeh amoh tana a bu anyimbehreh, Ada agbagba ambohroh Ishaku. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11" />Neh ma a hehreh a mara sehfeh mboh reh kpeh, ha mata a bleh la ma a lisa andromboh abibi ha alindeh, la andromboh ata Nnoh nza a kira reh ta ka a su ma ikpi seh a ŋoh reh: <verse eid="ROM 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12" />Nnoh ka a bleh ma Rebeka ma ikpi amehreh ata ŋoh nza a nati a mara reh la, &lt;&lt;Atsini agbaa a nati te ndohmoh ma atsini akehreh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13" />Tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh kira na Yakubu, neh meh ti leke Isuwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Mbohroh meh nati kǝ bleh la umbo? Nnoh reh a bu yehlehleh kpeh zizi? Uwa! a bu dehreh kpeh! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />Nnoh reh tana a bleh ma Musa la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:15">&lt;&lt;Meh nati tsana kwini amya na akyo ata mya nza ni bu na kwini na a ŋoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:15">tasa za meh nati lisa alindeh ma akyo ata mya nza ni nati lisa ŋoh alindeh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Ata areh a bu na na kira kyangwri ha wina ndohmoh a ŋoh kpeh, neh a bu na kwini Nnoh mi. <verse eid="ROM 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Amgbasho Nnoh reh a bleh reh andromboh ata Nnoh ta ka a bleh ma Firauna reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh tini gu nnoh ti bu Agohmoh ma Masar reh tsifa la, meh ti tsana wuwana amya na anzoh, la mata ahwra tsifa isa amya a treh atsifi ma inziyo areh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Nza ka a bu dehreh reh, Nnoh a nati a tsana kwini a ŋoh ma akyo ata nza a kira la mata a tsana ŋoh kwini, tasa za a nati a de agohsoh a wuwa ma akyo ata nza a kira mata a de agohsoh a ŋoh a wuwa reh.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gofo Nnoh Tasa Kwini Nnoh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Akyo amohnoh anyi a nati a bleh meh la,&lt;&lt;Nza ka a bu dehreh reh, a bu lele feh Nnoh a treh a nza reh na kpakpana a gu a ba ba a te nehnehreh? A bu anyi a nati a wina leke kira Nnoh reh? <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Nnoh reh neh ni kǝ bu anyi, nnoh kyangwri ata nza ni tsifa keh Nnoh na aniye reh? &lt;&lt;Azo ata nza ma a mina a nati a wina luhu akyo ata nza a mina ŋoh reh la, &lt;A bu mboh a te feh ni mina meh dehreh?&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Kyangwri mina azo lo reh a nati a wina te ndohmoh na lo reh ika ata ŋoh nza a kira reh na wuwana a ŋoh. A nati a wina te ndohmoh na kanji lo reh ta a mina mgbiri azo lo mboh reh mata a te ndohmoh alindeh na wohroh, mgbiri feh mata a te ndohmoh ata nza a zohhoh kpeh na wohroh.<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Ndohmoh Nnoh reh a bu dehreh. Ka a kira ta a tsana gofo a ŋoh a kate, tasa ka a tsana wuwana a ŋoh a kate ma inziyo. Ŋoh neh nimeh soh ivoh ma yira a de ikpi ahroh na amboh ata ŋoh nza a te gofo na amoh reh, amboh ata ma a tswa mata a lofo mboh. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Tasa za a kira ta a tsana agba a ŋoh a kate na amboh ata ŋoh nza a tsana mboh kwini a ŋoh reh, amboh ata ŋoh nza a lisa mboh a gya anyi jiji reh la mata a nga ŋoh agba. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Mbohroh reh meh bu kyangwri amboh ata Nnoh nza a fi reh reh, a sohroh a fi reh anyi na Yahudawa mboh tsene kpeh, neh a fi reh anyi na amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh za. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Tswanza nza ma a ŋa nimeh amgbasho Hosiya reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">&lt;&lt;Amboh ata nza ma a bu kyangwri amya mboh kpeh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">Meh nati fi mboh la, &lt;Kyangwri amya mboh.&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">Akpo inzi ata mya nza ni kira na amoh kpeh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">A bu wohroh meh nati fi la, &lt;Ata mya meh kira.&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />Tasa za, &lt;&lt;Ma atsi ata nza ma a bleh mboh la, &lt;Ni bu noh kyangwri amya mboh kpeh reh,&gt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">a bu ma a huru ma a nati a fi mboh la, &lt;mara Nnoh mboh ata nza a bu na fene.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Ma ikpi Israila mboh reh za, Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh bleh reh tana a vuru agba a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:27">&lt;&lt;Kyangwri Israila mboh reh ma bu gaga tswanza asehngeh fini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:27">a bu mboh shidi nza ma a nati a hunji nvara reh.<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />Ada reh a nati ahwra akpi ma inziyo reh nambri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:28">a nati ata a yanda kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Tswanza Ishaya ta ka a bleh na kpikpi ŋoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">Bu ma a bleh la a bu Ada agba ambohroh nambri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">ata reh alohsoh kpeh reh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:29">bu Mbohroh timi tswanza kyangwri Sodom mboh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:29">tasa za meh ti bu tswanza kyangwri Gomora mboh reh.<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israila Mboh Tasa Tsifa Nana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Meh nati kǝ bleh la mboh nehnehreh? A bu amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, nza ma a leke mata a fa aki tufa yehlehleh Nnoh reh kpeh, maka a hunji tufa yehlehleh reh, tufa yehlehleh ata mboh nza ma a hunji reh a bu biroh ika ata maka a hunji anyi ma aki nga agohsoh reh, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />mboh Israila mboh reh neh nza ma a leh a fa aki la mboh mata a hunji tufa yehlehleh ata Nnoh ma aki tufa akpi Musa reh, ma a sohroh a hunji kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />A bu mboh a te dehreh? A bu tsifa la ma a sohroh a fa ma aki nga agohsoh amoh reh kpeh, neh ma a fa ma aki te ndohmoh hunji firoh. Mboh reh maka a kpa hwana ma ikpi&lt;&lt;kpakpa kpa hwana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />Tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">&lt;&lt;Nza, meh gya kpakpa ma Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">ata kyangwri mboh ma a nati a kpa hwana ma ikpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">kpakpa reh a nati a de kyangwri mboh a hwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Akyo ata neh nza sa tsifa a ŋoh a kira reh, a nati a te ŋoh na sa kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, andromboh ata agohsoh amya nza ni kira tasa ata mya nza ni leh kwere Nnoh ma ikpi reh, a bu la kyangwri ambohroh mboh mata a hunji nvara, mya meh leh kwere Nnoh ma ikpi tsifa amboh wohroh reh. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Mya meh bleh tsifa ma ikpi amoh la ma a kira mata a tufa Nnoh alindeh. Mboh neh ma a sohroh a wina aki rya tohmoh ata ma a nati a tufa Nnoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Mboh reh ma za a wina aki ata Nnoh nza a nati a de kyangwri mboh reh mata a tufa ŋoh yehlehleh reh kpeh, mboh reh neh ma a kira la mata a fa aki amoh anyi tse, nza ka a bu dehreh reh ma a sohroh a fi ikpi amoh a na ma aki ata Nnoh a nati a de kyangwri mboh mata a bu amboh tufa yehlehleh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />Kristi kǝ de akpi reh ba ma trinaa, la amboh ata nza ma sa tsifa a ŋoh reh mata a bu amboh tufa yehlehleh ma tohmoh Nnoh.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nvara reh A bu Amoh Nambri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Musa reh tana a ŋa ma ikpi tufa yehlehleh ata maka a hunji anyi na akpi ata nza a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a tufa akpi Nnoh mboh reh yehlehleh, a nati a hunji fene ma aki wohroh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Ata areh neh a bu andromboh ata nza a bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh ma ikpi tufa yehlehleh ata ma aki nga agohsoh, &lt;&lt;Kama kohnoh nimeh agohsoh anzoh la, a bu anyi a nati a na inza?&gt;&gt; Ata areh a tsana la mata a de Kristi a tamba. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />&lt;&lt;Ha ti bleh la, &lt;A bu anyi a nati a wina tamba a na itsiyo ata kunu mboh nza ma a yama reh?&gt;&gt; (La ta a gyuru a yiri Kristi reh anyi ma kwo.) <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Amgbasho Nnoh reh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Tsifa Nnoh reh a bu ma inda anzoh, a bu ma aniye anzoh, tasa za a bu nimeh agohsoh anzoh&gt;&gt;Tsifa reh a bu tohmoh ata nga agohsoh ata Mbohroh nza meh leh hwra bleh reh. <verse eid="ROM 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Nza ni bleh na aniye anzoh la, Yeso reh a bu Ada, tasa za ti sa tsifa reh kira nyi ma agohsoh anzoh la a bu Nnoh a yiri ŋoh anyi ma kwo, ni nati hunji nvara. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />La ka a bu na agohsoh maka sa tsifa a kira mata la mata tufa yehlehleh, a bu ma aki bleh na aniye anzoh reh ni nati hunji nvara. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Amgbasho Nnoh reh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza sa tsifa a ŋoh a kira reh ma a nati a nga ŋoh na sa kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ata areh a mishi kyangwri mboh reh nambri, Yahudawa mboh tasa amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh ma bu atsetse kpeh. Ada nza bu anyimbehreh reh a bu Ada kyangwri mboh nambri, ŋoh reh ka a te atoh gaga ma amboh ata nza maka a fi sa a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Tswanza amgbasho tsifa Nnoh nza a bleh reh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a fi isa Ada la ta a shingi ŋoh reh, a nati a hunji nvara.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Mboh reh neh ma a nati a lisa lele feh masa a fi akyo ata mboh nza ma sa tsifa a ŋoh a kira kpeh la ta a shingi umbo? Tasa za ma a nati a lisa lele feh masa a sa tsifa a ŋoh reh a kira neh ma a hehreh a sehreh tsifa a ŋoh reh kpeh? Tasa za ma a nati a lisa lele feh masa a sehreh tsifa reh, nza akyo hwra bleh mboh reh ta a yama fya kpeh? <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Tasa za ma a nati a lisa lele feh masa ahwra tsifa reh a bleh, nza mata a tohmoh amboh sa tohmoh a kate fya kpeh reh? Amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ba amoh reh ka a nati a bu alindeh lele na amboh ata nza ma a nati a de tsifa nana a ba reh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Neh tana a bu Israilawa mboh nambri ma amoh tama ka sa tsifa nana reh kpeh. Tswanza Ishaya ta ka a bleh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, a ka a bu anyi a nati a sa tohmoh ata nza anyi na ambohroh reh a kira?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Nza ka a bu dehreh, nga agohsoh reh ka anyi ma atsi sere tohmoh, tasa sere tohmoh reh ka a ba anyi ma atsi hwra tsifa Kristi reh.<verse eid="ROM 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Mya neh meh luhu la: A bu zizi la Israilawa mboh reh nambri ma amoh tama a sohroh a sehreh tsifa reh kpeh? Mboh reh ma a sehreh. Tsifa Nnoh ata nza ma a ŋa a gya nimeh amgbasho reh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">&lt;&lt;Gohroh agba tohmoh amoh reh a treh atsifi ma inziyo reh nambri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">tsifa amoh mboh reh za a treh inziyo reh nambri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Mya meh gyuru luhu za la, ha kyangwri Israila mboh reh nambri ma a sohroh a sehreh tsifa reh a wina kpeh? A bu Musa na ikpi a ŋoh ta ka a jiji a kira mboh reh la Nnoh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt;Meh nati lisa ta a te nnoh na vene na kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu ma akpo afiya agba kpeh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">&lt;&lt;Meh nati lisa akpo afiya agba ata nza a bu na lomo kpeh reh ta a nga noh gofo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Tasa Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh reh za a wuwa agohsoh ta ka a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">&lt;&lt;A bu amboh ata nza ma a fa meh kpeh ma a hunji meh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">Meh tsana ikpi amya kate ma amboh ata ma a sohroh a luhu meh kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Ma ikpi kyangwri Israila mboh reh, Nnoh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:21">Na tutu meh kǝ tsitsi ivoh amya fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:21">kyangwri amboh ata maka a sehreh tsifa kpeh tasa amboh wuwa ikpi za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Nnoh A nza Kwini Israila Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Ta meh ti luhu nnoh fya, Nnoh reh ka a leke kyangwri a ŋoh mboh reh zizi? Uwa! A bu dehreh kpeh! Mya na ikpi amya meh bu kyangwri Israila, meh nyi alohsoh Ibrahim, tasa za meh bu arimi Benyamin mboh. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Nnoh a sohroh a leke kyangwri a ŋoh mboh amboh ata ŋoh nza a seh mboh anyi ma jiji reh kpeh. mohnoh ni wina noh andromboh ata amgbasho tsifa Nnoh nza a bleh ma ikpi Iliya reh, ŋoh tana a kwere Nnoh ma ikpi Israila mboh la, <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />&lt;&lt;Ada, ma a mla amboh sa tohmoh anzoh mboh reh a kwo, tasa za ma a druhu bagadi anzoh mboh, a bu mya tsimya mya nza ni tre hwa reh, ma a leh a fa akeki la mata a gu fene amya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Nnoh ka a sa ŋoh aniye reh la umbo? &lt;&lt;Meh gya ma ikpi amya kyangwri mboh dubu atehrehkifi, amboh ata ma a hehreh a susuna mata a krumusu nnoh akǝkehreh ata Baal reh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Ata areh a bu dehreh za nehnehreh, mgbiri kyangwri mboh amboh anyi za ma a yama amboh ata Nnoh nza seh mboh ma ikpi lisa alindeh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="ROM 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Iseh ata Nnoh nza a seh mboh reh a nza anyi na lisa alindeh a ŋoh, a sohroh a nza anyi na ndohmoh ata kyangwri mboh ma a lisa reh kpeh, ma a bu dehreh kpeh reh, lisa alindeh reh a nati a za bu lisa alindeh ata a zizi kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />nehnehreh a ka bu lele? Andromboh ata kyangwri Israila mboh nza ma a leh a fa reh ma a sohroh a hunji kpeh, a bu amboh tswa shidi ma nza ma seh mboh nimeh amoh reh ma a hunji, mgbiri amoh neh ma bu amboh wuwa ikpi. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Tswanza nza bu ŋa gyaa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">&lt;&lt;Nnoh nga mboh huru ata ma a nati a nza a wina kpeh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">tasa iyo ata ma a nati a wina nza na wohroh kpeh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:8">tasa ashotoh ata ma a nati a wina sehreh tsifa na wohroh kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:8">nza ka anyi ibi ata areh a gu a ba a te andrehmeh areh reh, ma a za a wina nza atsifi ha sehreh tsifa za kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Dawuda za tana a bleh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">Bu ma a de mboh mata a hwa nimeh arishi ma atsi rya irya kira amoh mboh reh.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">bu ma a kpa hwana mata a hwa, mata nga mboh iya za.<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Ta iyo amoh mboh ta a hwa shini mata a nza atsifi za kpeh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">meh kira la itoh amoh za ta a leh a wa iya na tutu<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Meh bu na luhu nehnehreh za, Yahudawa mboh ta maka a kpa hwana reh, tama a kpa la mata a hwa mata a za a hinga za kpeh? A bu dehreh kpeh! A bu tsifa kpakpana amoh mboh reh nvara a hunji mgbiri amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh la Israila mboh reh ma a te vene na amoh. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Nza kpakpana amoh a nati a de te atoh a ba ma inziyo reh, tasa za nza nyinana amoh Ma huru a nati a de te atoh a ba ma amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, te atoh reh a nati a bu gaga lele nza ma a mishi Israila mboh reh na agba ma.<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nvara amboh Ata Ma A bu Yahudawa Mboh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />nehnehreh meh tsifa na amohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. Mya nza ni bu kyangwri bleh tsifa nana Yeso na amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, meh nati riri ikpi amya nimeh te ndohmoh amya reh. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Ma aki wohroh reh, meh nati wina lisa kyangwri mboh nza ma a tswanza itoh amya reh mata a te vene ata nza a nati a de nvara a ba ma mgbiri amoh mboh. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Neh na ameh ata Nnoh nza ka a leke kyangwri Israila mboh reh, neh ta ka a gyuru a sa mgbiri kyangwri mboh inziyo areh a te iziza a ŋoh mboh. Nza Nnoh ka a sa kyangwri Israila mboh reh, wohroh a nati a gyuru a bu suhruna! A nati a bu fene ma amboh ata nza ma a kwo!<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Nza afohfohnoh ata jiji nga ma Nnoh reh a bu na zanana, mgbiri afohfohnoh reh nambri a nati a bu Nnoh ŋoh. Nza ariri agbeh mboh reh ma bu Nnoh a ŋoh, avohvoh agbeh mboh reh za ma bu na zanana. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Ma a shishimba mgbiri avohvoh agbeh akpehngeh ata nza ma a hafa reh, ma a gu avohvoh agbeh akpehngeh ata bini reh a dohsoh na wohroh, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh ni bu noh tswanza agbeh akpehngeh ata hohroh bini reh, nehnehreh neh ni gafa nnoh fene ata wuwana huru Yahudawa mboh reh nyi nnoh ma ariri. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Nza a bu dehreh reh, kama rina nnoh amboh ata nza ma a tswanza avohvoh agbeh amboh ata nza ma a bibiri reh kpeh. Ni nati gu ikpi ka noh lele? Ni bu noh avohvoh agbeh ma, ni sohroh shingi nnoh ariri agbeh reh kpeh, a bu ariri agbeh reh mi a shingi nnoh.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Nnoh neh ni nati wina bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh a biri avohvoh agbeh mboh reh la mata a wina dohsoh meh na chuhu agbeh reh ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />A bu dehreh zizi, tsifa ata mohnoh nza ni nga agohsoh amohnoh kpeh reh nza ma a bibiri nnoh anyi ma chuhu agbeh reh, nnoh feh a bu tsifa ata nza ni bu na nga agohsoh anzoh reh nza ma a treh ata nnoh na chuhu agbeh reh. Nnoh neh kama gu ikpi anzoh ka kpeh, ti gyuru nyiri ma. <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />Nnoh a sohroh ata Yahudawa mboh kpeh, mboh nza ma a tswanza avohvoh agbeh alindeh reh, nnoh ni nza anzoh la a nati a wina yi nnoh ta? <verse eid="ROM 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />nehnehreh mbohroh meh nati wina nza lisa alindeh Nnoh reh tasa meh ti kohnoh za la ha Nnoh reh a bu lele, ka nga iya ma amboh ata nza ma a hwa reh, ŋoh neh ta a tsana agohsoh alindeh a ŋoh na anzoh, nza ni leh rya tohmoh na ndohmoh alindeh a ŋoh reh, nza ka bu dehreh kpeh reh, nnoh za ma a nati a shimba anyi ma chuhu agbeh reh. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Nza kyangwri Israila mboh ma nga kira amoh na Kristi reh, Nnoh a nati a wina ta a gyuru a dohsoh mboh na ikpi a ŋoh tswanza nza maka a gyuru a dohsoh avohvoh agbeh mboh na chuhu agbeh yama reh. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, ni bu noh tswanza agbeh akpehngeh ata hohroh bini reh, ata maka a biri mata a dohsoh mboh ma akpehngeh ata maka a hafa ŋoh reh. Ata areh a sohroh a bu ma aki ata maka a dohsoh agbeh mboh kpeh. Mboh Israila mboh reh ma a tswanza akpehngeh ata maka a hafa reh, a nati a bu na iya kpeh ma Nnoh ta a gyuru a fira avohvoh agbeh amboh ata nza ma a biri anyi na agbeh alindeh reh a dohsoh a na yama.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nnoh A nza Kwini Kyangwri Mboh Nambri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, tsifa ayuhu ata a zizi anyi a yama ata meh kira la ti wina noh, a nati a ha nnoh ti kohnoh nnoh la ni bu noh na lomo. Vara kyangwri Israila mboh reh tama nga kira amoh ma Kristi kpeh. Ma a nati a leh a leke ŋoh la amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh tama a sa tsifa Nnoh reh a kira fya. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Ma aki wohroh reh ma a nati a sa Israila mboh a hwa na nambri. Tswanza nza ma a ŋa a gya nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">&lt;&lt;Ŋoh ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh a nati anyi Sihiyona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">a nati a katsi amboh agugu mboh reh nambri nza ma anyi alohsoh Yakubu reh.<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />Ata areh a bu tsifa ata mya nza ni nati bleh gya na amoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">ameh ata meh nati te kohhroh na kpakpana amoh mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Tsifa ata mboh nza ma a leke tsifa nana Nnoh reh, Yahudawa mboh reh ma a fi Nnoh ma tohmoh. Ata areh a bu la ta a shingi nnoh mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. Nza a bu ma ikpi seh Nnoh reh ma a bu ziza a ŋoh mboh, ata areh a bu andromboh ata nza ma a bleh ma Ada amoh mboh reh. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Nnoh reh a sohroh a sehneh agohsoh a ŋoh ma ikpi akyo ata ŋoh nza a seh ŋoh tasa ta a te ŋoh atoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Na kpikpi reh, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, tini kǝ wuwa nnoh ikpi ma Nnoh, nehnehreh neh Nnoh kǝ nza kwini amohnoh ma aki wuwa ikpi Yahudawa mboh reh. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ma aki wohroh reh, Yahudawa mboh reh ma a bu amboh wuwa ikpi na Nnoh tsifa la ma a nza kwini amoh, ata areh a hunji mboh la Nnoh ta a nza kwini amoh za. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Nnoh reh a de kyangwri mboh reh nambri a te tswanza ma a bu nimeh ida ka amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa kpeh reh, la ŋoh ta a nza kwini amoh nambri.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Asabara Nnoh reh a bu gaga lele! Lomo tasa wina a ŋoh reh za a bu gaga lele! Anyi a nati a wina nza kohnoh a ŋoh mboh reh a wina? Anyi za a nati a wina akeki a ŋoh mboh reh?<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />A bu anyi ata nza a wina agohsoh Nnoh reh?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">A bu anyi za a nati a wina tsana ŋoh lomo tsifa mboh reh?<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />A bu anyi kǝ nga andromboh ma Nnoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">ata mata a bleh la Nnoh a nati a gyuru nga ŋoh?<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />A bu ŋoh a lisa awumu mboh reh nambri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">tasa za awumu mboh reh nambri ma a hunji fene anyi na a ŋoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:36">ma a lisa mboh ma aki a ŋoh tasa tsifa a ŋoh za.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:36">Ta nga agba ta bu Nnoh a ŋoh ata tuma atono! Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Tuma Nimeh Ndohmoh Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Nza ka a bu dehreh mya meh kwere noh, ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh, tsifa kwini ata Nnoh nza a bu na wohroh reh, nga nnoh itoh amohnoh ma Nnoh awumu ngǝnga ata nza a bu na fene, ata zanana, tasa awumu ata Nnoh a ka a sa. Ata areh a bu krumusu ata a zizi. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Kama kira nnoh na kohnoh ika ata ameh ata areh ta a gyuru lomo amohnoh kpeh, mohnoh neh ta nnoh Nnoh ta a sehneh nnoh, ta a de kohnoh amohnoh tasa lomo amohnoh za a te afeh. Ma aki wohroh ni nati wina tsara nnoh andromboh ata nza bu kohnoh Nnoh reh. Andromboh ata nza a bu alindeh na a ŋoh tasa ata nza a zohhoh ŋoh reh a bu yehlehleh.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />A bu ma ikpi lisa alindeh ata nza ma a lisa meh reh, meh buti bleh noh la, akyo anyi ta a sohroh a gu ikpi a ŋoh a ka a keh atsi ata ŋoh nza a bu reh kpeh. nza ka a bu dehreh neh, ti lisa kohnoh na ikpi anzoh ve. Ti gu ma agohsoh anzoh biroh nga agohsoh ata Nnoh nza nga noh reh. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Meh bu na bǝba itoh mboh gaga nimeh itoh anyimbehreh, bǝba itoh mboh reh nambri ma a bu na ndohmoh amoh ma atsetse. <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />Ma aki wohroh za, mbohroh nza meh bu gaga reh, itoh ambohroh a bu anyimbehreh nimeh Kristi, tasa za nambri ma ambohroh meh bu bǝba itoh atohngoh ambohroh mboh. <verse eid="ROM 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Mbohroh neh meh ti te ndohmoh na ngǝnga mboh ma atsetse ata nza bu yehlehleh na lisa alindeh ata Nnoh nza nga reh reh. Nza ngǝnga ambohroh a bu ata bleh tsifa Nnoh reh, mbohroh meh ti lisa ta bu yehlehleh na nga agohsoh ata mbohroh nza meh bu na wohroh reh; <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Nza ngǝnga ambohroh a bu ata te ndohmoh ŋa, meh ti te ndohmoh na wohroh, nza a bu ata tsana reh mbohroh meh ti tsana, <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />nza a bu ata nga wuwa agohsoh ma mgbiri mboh reh, meh ti lisa dehreh, ha nza ngǝnga reh a bu ata meh ti shingi itoh ambohroh reh, ta a te reh iko meh ti lisa na agohsoh anyimbehreh, ha nza a bu ata de agba reh, meh ti de na wuwana, ha nza a bu ata nza kwini reh, meh ti lisa na johjoh.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsana Kira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />A zohhoh kira amohnoh ta a bu ata a zizi ŋoh. Leke nnoh andromboh ata nza a bu ata agugu reh, ti de noh andromboh ata nza a bu alindeh reh. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Nga noh ikpi amohnoh ma itoh amohnoh tasa kira ika ata atsi mboh. ka anyi ma ta nga agba na afri ma akyo ata a keh kpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Lisa ndohmoh wuwana nnoh, ti kama te nnoh yangru kpeh. mohnoh neh ta a te nnoh iko te ndohmoh ma Ada na agohsoh amohnoh nimeh huru. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Ta nnoh gya agohsoh amohnoh reh ta nga noh nana agohsoh, ti bu noh na soh ivoh ma yira nimeh iya, tasa za ti bu noh amboh kwere Nnoh na tutu. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Ti gafa nnoh andromboh ata ni bu noh na wohroh reh ma amohnoh mboh amboh zanana mboh, tasa za ti vuru afya anzoh ma sehneh mboh.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Bleh nnoh Nnoh ta a te atoh ma amboh ata nza ma a leh nga nnoh iya reh, haa, ti luhu nnoh ta a te mboh atoh, ta a sohroh nga mboh aniye kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Bu nnoh na johjoh na amboh ata nza ma a bu na johjoh reh, ti kpanga nnoh na amboh ata nza ma a leh a kpanga reh. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />tuma noh alindeh na itoh amohnoh. Kama gu ikpi ka noh kpeh, tasa za ti kuku ikpi tamba nnoh na amboh ata ma bu andromboh kpeh. Kama kohnoh la ni bu noh lomo kpeh.<verse eid="ROM 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Nza akyo a lisa nnoh andromboh abibi, kama fanga ŋoh na andromboh abibi kpeh. Fa aki ti lisa andromboh ata kyangwri mboh ma a nati a nza la a zohhoh. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza ni nati wina lisa nnoh reh, ti tuma noh alindeh na kyangwri mboh nambri. na trina, nza a nati a zohhoh, ti tuma noh alindeh na itoh amohnoh. <verse eid="ROM 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />ambohroh mboh, kama bu noh amboh gu vari ma ikpi amohnoh kpeh, mohnoh neh ti ta nnoh Nnoh ta a gu vari na gofo a ŋoh, amgbasho Nnoh reh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Gu vari a bu amya, meh nati nza yehlehleh, Ada reh a bleh dehreh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Tsifa Nnoh a gyuru a bleh za la, &lt;&lt;Nza inyo a keh amboh fi ma tohmoh anzoh mboh reh, nga mboh nnoh amwo wa, a bu ma aki lisa dehreh ŋa ni nati mishi mboh sehsehreh shira ma ikpi amoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Kama ta nnoh agugu ta a keh wuwana amohnoh kpeh; mohnoh neh, ti keh nnoh wuwana agugu reh na lisa alindeh.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Nga Agba Ma Agbugba Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh na fene reh, ni nati tufa nnoh wuwana agbugba ata gomnati kanga, la Agohmoh anyi a ka a tuma na wuwana ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh kpeh nza a bu Nnoh a gya ŋoh feh, agohgohmoh amboh ata nza ma a tuma ma ikpi kpra na wuwana Agohmoh reh a bu Nnoh a gya mboh. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Nza a bu dehreh akyo ata nza a la kpeh na agohgohmoh mboh reh a la kpeh na andromboh ata Nnoh nza a gya; akyo ata nza a lisa dehreh a de ikpi a ŋoh a fi nimeh iya. <verse eid="ROM 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />amboh ata nza ma a lisa yehlehleh, maka a nyiri agohgohmoh mboh kpeh, neh a ka a bu amboh ata nza ma a lisa agugu mi. Ni nati kira ti nyiri agbugba mboh kpeh? Neh lisa andromboh ata nza a zohhoh, ma a nati a ringa nnoh, <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />la mboh reh ma a bu ahwra Nnoh mboh ma a te ndohmoh la ta a zohhoh nnoh. Nza ni te ndohmoh agugu neh, nyiri mboh, la ma a bu na wuwana nga iya ata a zizi. Ma a bu kyangwri ndohmoh Nnoh mboh tasa za maka a de iya a ba ma amboh ata nza ma a te ndohmoh agugu. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Tsifa wohroh ni nati nga nnoh agba ma agbugba mboh kanga, ta a kama a bu tsifa nyiri iya nza anyi na Nnoh tsene kpeh, neh ta a bu tsifa agohsoh za. <verse eid="ROM 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />A bu tsifa wohroh reh nza ni fanga nnoh gandu za reh, la agbugba mboh reh ma a leh a te ndohmoh ma Nnoh nza ma a treh ndohmoh amoh mboh ma Nnoh reh. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Fanga nnoh andromboh ata nza ma a tufa nnoh reh; fanga mboh nnoh gandu ata ikpi amohnoh tasa ata awumu amohnoh mboh, tasa ti nga mboh nnoh agba nambri ma amoh.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kira Na Atohngoh anzoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Kama ta nnoh tsifa kira na atohngoh amohnoh kpeh, wohroh ta a bu kohfoh. akyo ata nza a lisa dehreh kǝ tufa amgbasho akpi reh. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ma ta ka a bleh a gya reh la, &lt;&lt;Kama leh ahohndoh kpeh; kama mla akyo kwo kpeh; kama te ayuhu kpeh; kama te iyo awumu akyo kpeh; amboh areh nambri tasa amboh tswa,&gt;&gt; ma a lisa anyi nimeh chuhu tsifa &lt;&lt;kira na atohngoh anzoh tswanza ikpi anzoh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Nza ni kira na mgbiri kyangwri mboh, ni nati sohroh lisa mboh andromboh abibi kpeh, kira na amoh reh a bu tufa amgbasho akpi reh nambri.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kristi Kǝ Ba Whiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Ni nati lisa nnoh dehreh kanga, la ni wina noh la ameh kǝ ba ata nza ni nati hinga nyi nnoh ma mla. La ameh ata nza meh nati hunji nvara reh kǝ bu whiri ma nehnehreh a keh ameh ata meh ti kǝ jiji nga agohsoh reh. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Shini waka a gǝga, nerebi kǝ ba whiri. Ba turoh meh ti ta lisa awumu ika ata shini reh, meh ti fira awumu mlana gofo na iyo zanana. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Ba turoh meh ti ta vene, meh ti lisa de ikpi ambohroh alindeh, ika ata kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a tuma nimeh zanana ata ibi, kama leh nnoh ahohndoh ha wa nnoh awumu te ifiya kpeh, <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />mohnoh neh fira nnoh awumu mlana gofo ata Ada Yeso Kristi, ti ta nnoh aki kpakpana ata itoh nza ka a kira lisa reh.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Kama Hwra Akpi Ma Atohngoh Anzoh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Ta nnoh sende na itoh amohnoh ti Sa noh kyangwri ata nga agohsoh amoh na Nnoh nza a wuwana kpeh reh, neh ti kama hwa nnoh aniye na amoh ma ikpi nga agohsoh amoh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Akyo anyi ka sa tsifa a kira la ŋoh ta a rya awumu mboh reh nambri, neh kyangwri ata nga agohsoh a ŋoh kǝ hehreh wuwana kpeh a ka a rya asho ma. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />kyangwri ata nza a rya awumu mboh nambri ta kama a nza la ŋoh a keh ata nza a rya kpeh reh; ata nza a rya asho ma reh ta a kama ahwra akpi ma ata nza a rya awumu mboh nambri reh kpeh; la Nnoh kǝ sa kyangwri wohroh. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />Nnoh ni bu anyi ti hwra akpi ma ahwra akyo? A bu Ada amoh mi a nati a kohnoh a nza ha ma a lisa alindeh ha ma a lisa abibi. Ma a nati a lisa alindeh la ada amoh reh a nati a shingi mboh mata a lisa alindeh.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Kyangwri amboh anyi ma a kohnoh la ibi anyi a keh mgbiri ibi mboh, amboh tswa neh ma a kohnoh la ibi mboh reh ma a bu anyimbehreh nambri. Anyima nambri ma ambohroh meh ti hwra akpi, ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a zohhoh reh nimeh agohsoh ambohroh mboh. <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Kyangwri amboh ata nza ma kohnoh mata nga agba ma ibi anyi, ma a lisa dehreh la mata nga Ada agba, la mboh ma kwende Nnoh ma ikpi awumu rya reh. amboh ata nza ma a leke mata a rya awumu amboh anyi ma a lisa dehreh la mata nga Ada agba tasa za ma a kwende Nnoh. <verse eid="ROM 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Mbohroh meh sohroh tuma ma ikpi ambohroh tsene kpeh, tasa za meh sohroh kwo ma ikpi ambohroh tsene kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Nza meh tuma na fene, meh tuma ma Ada, nza meh kwo, meh kwo ma Ada. Nza a bu dehreh ha meh tuma na fene ha Mbohroh meh kwo, Mbohroh meh bu Ada a ŋoh. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Kristi a kwo ka a gyuru a hinga anyi ma kwo la ŋoh ta a bu Ada ata amboh fene tasa ata amboh nza ma a kwo.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Nnoh neh ata nza ni rya asho mboh ma, ni lisa lele feh si hwra akpi ma amboh tswa? Nnoh ata nza ni rya awumu mboh nambri reh, ni lisa lele feh si sende mgbiri amboh tufa mboh reh? nambri ma ambohroh meh nati shi ma tohmoh Nnoh ta ahwra reh akpi. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Amgbasho Nnoh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">&lt;&lt;Ada a bleh la, mya nza ni bu a zizi Nnoh ata nza a bu na fene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">kyangwri nambri ma a nati a gya gboro ma tohmoh amya, mata a bleh la mya meh bu Nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Nza a bu dehreh nambri ma ambohroh anyinyi, a nati a bleh ndohmoh a ŋoh ma Nnoh.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kama Lisa Atohngoh Anzoh Ta A hwa Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Nza a bu dehreh, ba nnoh meh ti ta hwra akpi ma itoh ambohroh. Neh, anyima ta a gu ma agohsoh a ŋoh la, ŋoh a nati a lisa andromboh ata nza a nati a yi amboh tswa a hwa nimeh kpakpana kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Mya nza ni bu na Ada Yeso, agohsoh amya a bu anyimbehreh ma la, awumu rya anyi a sohroh a bu abibi kpeh; neh nza ni nza la awumu rya amboh anyi a sohroh a zanana kpeh. ka a nati a bu na zanana kpeh na anzoh. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Nza ni kira atohngoh anzoh ta a kputu agohsoh ma ikpi andromboh ata nza ni rya, neh ni sohroh lisa nyi nimeh agohsoh kira kpeh. Kama kira andromboh ata nza ni rya ta a de atohngoh anzoh ata Kristi nza a kwo tsifa a ŋoh a te abibi kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Kama kira andromboh ata nza ni nza la a zohhoh ta a bu abibi ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />De Agohmoh Nnoh reh a sohroh a bu tsifa rya ha tsifa wa kpeh, neh a bu ata bu yehlehleh tasa tuma alindeh, tasa nza nana ata huru zanana nza a de a ba, <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Nza ni te ahwra Nnoh ma aki wohroh, ni nati kuku agohsoh ma Nnoh tasa za mgbiri kyangwri mboh ma a nati a kira na amoh. <verse eid="ROM 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Nza a bu dehreh, a zohhoh meh ti fa akeki ata nza a nati a de tuma alindeh a ba ata nza a nati a shingi a de wuwana a ba ma kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Kama nasa andromboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa la tsifa rya kpeh. Awumu rya mboh reh nambri ma a bu na rya, neh a bu abibi akyo ta a rya andromboh ata nza a nati a de akyo anyi a fi nimeh kpakpana. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh reh a bu ata leke rya uwo, wa amwo inabi, ha lisa andromboh ata nza a nati a de kyangwri tufa a fi nimeh kpakpana. <verse eid="ROM 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />De andromboh ata nza ni nga agohsoh anzoh ma ikpi ata areh, neh, mohnoh ma Nnoh ma tsene. Johjoh a bu na amboh ata agohsoh amoh nza a sohroh ahwra mboh akpi ma aki lisa andromboh ata mboh nza ma bu abibi ma iyo amoh kpeh reh! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Nza agohsoh amoh a keshe mboh ma ikpi andromboh ata mboh nza ma a rya, Nnoh a nasa mboh nza ma a rya, la ndohmoh amoh reh a sohroh a bu ata nga agohsoh kpeh. Tasa andromboh ata nza a sohroh a bu ata nza anyi nimeh nga agohsoh kpeh, a bu kpakpana.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Kama Lisa Alindeh Ma Ikpi Anzoh Kpeh, Lisa Ma Mgbiri Kyangwri Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Mbohroh amboh ata nza meh bu na wuwana nimeh nga agohsoh, a zohhoh meh ti shingi amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh iya reh kanga, meh ti kama lisa alindeh ma ikpi ambohroh kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Neh, meh ti lisa andromboh ata nza a zohhoh ma mgbiri amboh tufa mboh reh tsifa la ma a lisa alindeh, la meh ti lisa mboh mata a rya tohmoh nimeh nga agohsoh. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" />La Kristi a sohroh a lisa alindeh ma ikpi a ŋoh kpeh. Neh, tswanza amgbasho Nnoh nza a bleh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ikya mboh ata nza ma a kya nnoh kǝ tamba ma ikpi amya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Awumu mboh nambri ma ta ka a ŋa nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh, tama a ŋa la a tsana reh, la meh ti hunji gya agohsoh ma aki soh ivoh yira tasa nga wuwa agohsoh ata amgbasho Nnoh nza nga reh reh. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Nnoh, ta nga reh soh ivoh yira tasa nga wuwana, ata bu noh na kohnoh anyimbehreh na itoh amohnoh ma aki tufa hende Kristi Yeso, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />La mohnoh nambri ma amohnoh ti wina riri nnoh Nnoh tasa Ada ata Ada ambohroh na agba anyimbehreh.<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tsifa Nana Ma amboh Ata Nza Ma A bu Yahudawa Mboh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Sa noh itoh amohnoh, la Nnoh ta a hunji nga agba, ika ata Kristi ta ka a sa noh reh. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Meh bleh noh la Kristi a te ndohmoh ahwra ma aniye Yahudawa mboh, ta tsana la Nnoh a bleh tsifa a ŋoh a su, ta ka a bleh ma Ada amoh mboh reh kǝ bu zizi, <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />tasa ta nga amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh za wuwana mata ariri Nnoh ma tsifa kwini a ŋoh. Amgbasho a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati kpa amumu riri isa anzoh nimeh amboh ata nza ma a sohroh a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh; Meh nati kpa amumu riri nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />A gyuru a bleh za la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">&lt;&lt;Johjoh nnoh, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni sohroh bu noh Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, na kyangwri Nnoh mboh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="ROM 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Tasa za,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">&lt;&lt;Riri nnoh Ada, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni wina noh Nnoh kpeh reh nambri;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">riri nnoh, mohnoh kyangwri mboh nambri!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Tasa za, Ishaya kyangwri bleh tsifa Nnoh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">Alohsoh Yesse anyi a nati a kate;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">a nati a ba ba a te Agohmoh amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">ma a nati a gya agohsoh na a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Nnoh ata nza a bu chuhu gya agohsoh, ta nga noh johjoh tasa tuma alindeh nambri nimeh nga agohsoh amohnoh na a ŋoh, la gya agohsoh amohnoh reh a rya tohmoh ma aki te agba nimeh wuwana ata huru zanana.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chuhu Tsifa Wuwana Ata Ablusu Nza A ŋa Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Kyangwri tufa mboh: Mya na ikpi amya meh wina la ndohmoh alindeh a su nimeh agohsoh amohnoh, tasa la ni wina tsana noh itoh amohnoh. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Nimeh amgbasho ata areh neh, Meh bu gbalala ma ikpi awumu amboh ata mya nza ni jiji kohnoh nnoh reh. Meh bleh shimba ma ikpi aki ata Nnoh nza nga meh reh <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />ata bu ahwra Kristi Yeso meh ti te ndohmoh firist ma amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh. Meh te ndohmoh tswanza kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ma aki hwra tsifa nana nza anyi na Nnoh, la amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh mata a bu nga alindeh ma Nnoh, ata huru zanana nza a lisa a gya Nnoh. <verse eid="ROM 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Nimeh Kristi Yeso, meh nati rya itoh na ndohmoh amya na ma Nnoh. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Meh nati tsifa na wuwana ma aki tsifa ma ikpi andromboh ata Kristi nza a lisa nimeh amya la meh ti tsana ma amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh mata a tufa Nnoh. A lisa meh dehreh nimeh tsifa tasa nimeh ndohmoh mboh, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />nimeh wuwana ata ndohmoh ŋara aniye, tasa nimeh wuwana ata Huru zanana Nnoh. Ma aki hende nyi Urushalima na Iliriku, mya meh hwra tsifa nana ma ikpi Kristi bleh. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Kira amya a ka a bu ata bleh tsifa nana ma akpokpo atsifi mboh nambri ata nza ma a sohroh a sehreh tsifa Kristi kpeh reh, la ta kama a bu la meh mina ma ikpi chuhu ida ata akyo anyi nza a mina kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Amgbasho Nnoh a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">&lt;&lt;amboh ata ma ta ka a bleh mboh tsifa ma ikpi a ŋoh kpeh mata a nza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">tasa amboh ata nza ma a sohroh a sehreh kpeh mata a nza a wina.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu A nati A na Roma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Tasa a ha meh ba na amohnoh a te soh vara. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />nehnehreh mya nza ni te ndohmoh amya tre ma akpo inzi ata areh neh, tasa za nza meh tini kira meh ti ba na amohnoh ma ahuhushi mboh gaga reh, <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Meh gya agohsoh meh ti lisa dehreh nehnehreh. Meh nati kira meh ti nza ma aki na Sifen, tasa ti shingi meh noh ma aki na a huru, nza meh nza nana ba na amohnoh shidi. <verse eid="ROM 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />nehnehreh neh, meh na amya Urushalima ma aki te ndohmoh zanana ma kyangwri Nnoh mboh ma a huru. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />amboh tufa mboh ma Makidoniya tasa Akaya ma a kira na dohsoh ikpi amoh la mboh ma a nati a shingi amboh iya mboh ma Urushalima. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Kira wohroh a bu kira amoh; neh, ma tsifa a zizi, ma a nati a shingi mboh kanga. Yahudawa mboh ma a gafa awumu amoh mboh ma amboh ata nza ma a sohroh a bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh, amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh za mata a gafa awumu amoh mboh ata huru mata a shingi Yahudawa mboh. <verse eid="ROM 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Nza meh tre ndohmoh ata areh, tasa meh ti gyuru hungroh ata nza ma a dohsoh mboh reh nambri, meh nati na amya Sifen tasa meh ti ba na amohnoh ma aki gǝga. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Nza meh ba na amohnoh, meh wina la meh nati ba na te atoh gaga ata Kristi.<verse eid="ROM 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Meh bleh noh, Kyangwri tufa mboh, na isa Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi tasa kira ata huru nza a de a ba: Kavohshama ba bu shingi meh noh kwere Nnoh. <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />Kwere noh Nnoh la ta a sa meh a hwa na na amboh ata nza ma a wina Nnoh kpeh ma Yahudiya tasa la Kyangwri Nnoh mboh mata a sa te ndohmoh zanana amya ma Urushalima. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Meh nati ba na amohnoh na johjoh gaga, nza bu kira Nnoh, la meh ti nza nana ba na amohnoh. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Nnoh, ata nza a bu zizi chuhu tuma alindeh ambohroh, ta a bu na amohnoh nambri. Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Ablusu Atsifa Na Kyangwri Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Meh kira ti wina noh la asra ambohroh Fibi, a bu kyangwri alindeh ata nza a te ndohmoh ida Nnoh ma amboh tufa mboh ma Kankiriya. <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />Sa noh afiya reh nimeh isa Ada, ika ata maka a sa kyangwri Nnoh amboh zanana mboh reh, shingi nnoh ma aki ata nza a kira shingi anyi na amohnoh reh; ŋoh na ikpi a ŋoh za tana a lisa alindeh ma kyangwri amboh tufa mboh gaga tasa mya za.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Tsifa meh noh na Biriskila tasa Akila, nza ma a bu atohngoh ambohroh ma atsi ndohmoh nimeh Kristi Yeso; <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />ma a gu fene amoh a fi nimeh iya tsifa amya. Meh kwende mboh, a bu mya tsimya kpeh, tasa mgbiri amboh tufa mboh amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh za. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Tsifa meh noh na amboh tufa mboh nza maka a dohsohna ma afya amoh reh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Meh tsifa na Afanitusu, iza amya ata mya nza ni kira reh, ŋoh tana a jiji a nga kira Kristi ma akpo afiya Asiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Tsifa meh noh na Maryamu, ŋoh nza a te noh ndohmoh a wuwana reh. <verse eid="ROM 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Tsifa meh noh na Andaronikus tasa Yuniya, nza ma a bu atohngoh ambohroh Yahudawa mboh nimeh ida ka na amya reh; ma a wina mboh gaga nimeh amboh sa tohmoh nana, tasa tama a jiji a bu nimeh Kristi na amya. <verse eid="ROM 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Tsifa meh noh na Amfiliyatus za, iza amya ata mya nza ni kira reh nimeh dohsohkpi ata Ada. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Tsifa meh noh na Urbanus za, nza bu atohngoh ambohroh ma atsi ndohmoh nimeh Kristi, tasa Sitakis iza amya ata mya nza ni kira reh. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Tsifa meh noh na Afalisu ata ndohmoh alindeh a ŋoh nimeh Kristi reh a bu zizi. Tsifa meh noh na amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh afiya Aristobulusu. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Tsifa meh noh na Hirudiyan, nza a bu atohngoh ambohroh kyangwri Yahudawa reh, ti tsifa meh noh za na amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh Ada reh, ma afya Narkisu. <verse eid="ROM 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Tsifa meh noh na Tirayifina Tirayifusa, nza ma a te ndohmoh nimeh ndohmoh Ada, tasa iza amya ata mya nza ni kira reh, a bu Farsis, ŋoh ta ka a te ndohmoh gaga ma Ada reh.<verse eid="ROM 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abitrusu A bleh Ma Ikpi Amehreh Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Tsifa meh noh na Rufus, Kyangwri ndohmoh alindeh ata nza ma a seh ŋoh nimeh ndohmoh Ada, tasa akre za, ata nza a de meh tswanza meh bu amehreh a ŋoh. <verse eid="ROM 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Tsifa meh noh na Asinkiritus tasa Filigona, tasa Hermes, tasa Faturobas, tasa Harmasa, tasa amboh tufa mboh nza ma a bu ma amoh reh. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Tsifa meh noh na Filologus, tasa Yuliya, tasa Niriyusu, tasa asra, tasa Olimfas, tasa kyangwri Nnoh amboh zanana mboh nza ma a yama mboh ma amoh reh. <verse eid="ROM 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Tsifa nnoh na itoh amohnoh, ti fla itoh amohnoh de noh ata zanana. amboh tufa Kristi mboh nambri ma atsifa na amohnoh za.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu Akpi Ashotoh Ata Trinaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Meh kwere nnoh, mohnoh ambohroh mboh amboh tufa mboh: Lisa nza noh amboh ata nza maka a de gafana tasa kpakpa kpa hwana a ba nnoh la ti kpa nnoh hwana, tasa za maka a leh a fi noh ma tohmoh ma ikpi tsana ata ti kǝ sa nnoh reh. Kama dohsoh noh ikpi amohnoh na amoh kpeh! <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />amboh ata nza ma a lisa ika wohroh reh ma a sohroh te ndohmoh ma Kristi Ada ambohroh reh kpeh, neh a zaka a bu kira agohsoh amoh mi. Na wina tsifa amoh tasa tsifa alindeh amoh maka a leh a landa kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a wina lomo kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Kyangwri mboh nambri ma a wina la ni tufa nnoh Nnoh reh alindeh nimeh bleh tsifa, ma ikpi tsifa wohroh meh johjoh tsifa anzoh. Meh kira ti bu na lomo ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a zohhoh reh, neh mata kama a hunji noh na kpakpana ma ikpi andromboh ata nza a bu agugu kpeh. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Nnoh, nza a bu chuhu tuma alindeh ambohroh, kǝ ba hwiri ta anunu agugu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:20">Kwini ata Ada ambohroh Yeso ta a bu na amohnoh.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoti, atohngoh ambohroh ma atsi ndohmoh, a tsifa na amohnoh; tasa Lushiyu, Yason, tasa Yosifa, Sosifata nza ma a bu atohngoh ambohroh Yahudawa mboh reh.<verse eid="ROM 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Mya, Tartiyus, mya mi ŋa amgbasho ata areh, meh tsifa na amohnoh nimeh isa Ada ika ata amboh tufa Kristi mboh.<verse eid="ROM 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Kyangwri ata nza a sa meh reh a bu Gayus, ata amboh tufa mboh nza maka a dohsohna ma afya a ŋoh, atsifa na amohnoh; Erastus, nza a bu kyangwri de hungroh ata akpo afya reh tasa atsi ambohroh kwartusu atsifa na amohnoh. <verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />Meh kwere Ada ambohroh Yeso Kristi la, ta a lisa nnoh alindeh nambri ma amohnoh.<verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ablusu A kwere Nnoh Ata Trina Ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />Ba nnoh meh ti nga ma Nnoh agba! A nga nnoh agohsoh shi wuwana nimeh nga agohsoh, a bu tsifa nana ata mya nza ni hwra bleh ma ikpi Yeso Kristi tasa ma ikpi tsifa ata a zizi ata ma ta ka a vuru anyi ma huho, na amehmeh na kiri ata tuma atono reh. <verse eid="ROM 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />Nehnehreh, tsifa a zizi wohroh reh maa a vuru a kate nimeh amgbasho amboh sa tsifa Nnoh a bleh; tasa nimeh bleh tsifa Nnoh ata tuma atono, ma a tsana Nnoh reh a kate ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh nambri, la kyangwri nambri mata nga agohsoh, tasa mata a sa tsifa a kira mata a tufa za. <verse eid="ROM 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Na Nnoh anyimbehreh, ŋoh tsene nza a bu na lomo mboh reh nambri zizi, riri za ta a bu a ŋoh nimeh Yeso Kristi ata tuma atono! Avoh dehreh.<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>